\v 1 Yahweh, how \w my|strong="H1732"\w* adversaries \w have|strong="H1121"\w* increased! Many \w are|strong="H1121"\w* \w those|strong="H1121"\w* \w who|strong="H1121"\w* rise \w up|strong="H1121"\w* \w against|strong="H6440"\w* \w me|strong="H6440"\w*.\
