\p## Evening song of a godly man in time of trouble
For the Chief Musician; on stringed instruments. A Psalm by David. 
\v 1 Answer me when I call, God \w of|strong="H1732"\w* \w my|strong="H1732"\w* righteousness. Give me relief from \w my|strong="H1732"\w* distress. \w Have|strong="H1732"\w* mercy \w on|strong="H5058"\w* me, \w and|strong="H1732"\w* hear \w my|strong="H1732"\w* prayer.\
