\v 8 Depart \w from|strong="H5869"\w* \w me|strong="H5869"\w*, \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w you|strong="H3605"\w* workers \w of|strong="H5869"\w* iniquity, \w for|strong="H3605"\w* Yahweh \w has|strong="H5869"\w* heard \w the|strong="H3605"\w* voice \w of|strong="H5869"\w* \w my|strong="H3605"\w* weeping.\
\v 9 \w Yahweh|strong="H3068"\w* \w has|strong="H3068"\w* \w heard|strong="H8085"\w* \w my|strong="H3605"\w* supplication. \w Yahweh|strong="H3068"\w* accepts \w my|strong="H3605"\w* prayer.\
\v 10 \w May|strong="H3068"\w* all \w my|strong="H8085"\w* enemies \w be|strong="H3068"\w* ashamed \w and|strong="H3068"\w* dismayed. \w They|strong="H3068"\w* \w shall|strong="H3068"\w* turn \w back|strong="H3947"\w*, \w they|strong="H3068"\w* \w shall|strong="H3068"\w* \w be|strong="H3068"\w* disgraced suddenly.
