\v 5 let \w the|strong="H0518"\w* \w enemy|strong="H6887"\w* pursue \w my|strong="H0518"\w* soul, and overtake \w it|strong="H0518"\w*; yes, let \w him|strong="H1580"\w* tread \w my|strong="H0518"\w* life down \w to|strong="H0518"\w* \w the|strong="H0518"\w* earth, and lay \w my|strong="H0518"\w* glory \w in|strong="H0518"\w* \w the|strong="H0518"\w* dust. Selah.\
