\v 7 Let \w the|strong="H3068"\w* congregation \w of|strong="H3068"\w* \w the|strong="H3068"\w* peoples surround \w you|strong="H6680"\w*. \w Rule|strong="H4941"\w* \w over|strong="H6965"\w* \w them|strong="H6680"\w* \w on|strong="H3068"\w* \w high|strong="H5375"\w*.\
\v 8 Yahweh administers judgment \w to|strong="H7725"\w* \w the|strong="H5921"\w* \w peoples|strong="H3816"\w*. Judge \w me|strong="H5921"\w*, Yahweh, \w according|strong="H5921"\w* \w to|strong="H7725"\w* \w my|strong="H5921"\w* righteousness, \w and|strong="H7725"\w* \w to|strong="H7725"\w* \w my|strong="H5921"\w* integrity \w that|strong="H7725"\w* \w is|strong="H4791"\w* \w in|strong="H5921"\w* \w me|strong="H5921"\w*.\
