For the Chief Musician. Set to “The Death of the Son.” A Psalm by David. 
\v 1 I will give thanks \w to|strong="H1732"\w* Yahweh \w with|strong="H1732"\w* \w my|strong="H1732"\w* whole heart. I will tell \w of|strong="H1732"\w* all \w your|strong="H1732"\w* marvelous works.\
