\v 5 \w The|strong="H4194"\w* \w cords|strong="H2256"\w* \w of|strong="H4194"\w* Sheol\f + \fr 18:5 \ft Sheol is the place of the dead. \f* \w were|strong="H4194"\w* around \w me|strong="H0661"\w*. \w The|strong="H4194"\w* snares \w of|strong="H4194"\w* \w death|strong="H4194"\w* came \w on|strong="H4194"\w* \w me|strong="H0661"\w*.\
