\v 7 \w Then|strong="H0935"\w* \w the|strong="H6440"\w* earth shook \w and|strong="H0935"\w* trembled. \w The|strong="H6440"\w* foundations \w also|strong="H3068"\w* \w of|strong="H0430"\w* \w the|strong="H6440"\w* mountains quaked \w and|strong="H0935"\w* \w were|strong="H0430"\w* shaken, \w because|strong="H6440"\w* \w he|strong="H0430"\w* \w was|strong="H3068"\w* angry.\
\v 8 Smoke went out \w of|strong="H0776"\w* \w his|strong="H3588"\w* nostrils. Consuming fire came out \w of|strong="H0776"\w* \w his|strong="H3588"\w* mouth. Coals \w were|strong="H2022"\w* \w kindled|strong="H2734"\w* \w by|strong="H0776"\w* \w it|strong="H3588"\w*.\
