\v 10 \w He|strong="H5186"\w* rode \w on|strong="H8478"\w* \w a|strong="H5186"\w* cherub, \w and|strong="H8064"\w* flew. Yes, \w he|strong="H5186"\w* soared \w on|strong="H8478"\w* \w the|strong="H8478"\w* wings \w of|strong="H8478"\w* \w the|strong="H8478"\w* wind.\
