\v 20 Yahweh \w has|strong="H3318"\w* rewarded \w me|strong="H3318"\w* according \w to|strong="H3318"\w* \w my|strong="H3318"\w* righteousness. According \w to|strong="H3318"\w* \w the|strong="H3588"\w* cleanness of \w my|strong="H3318"\w* hands, \w he|strong="H3588"\w* \w has|strong="H3318"\w* recompensed \w me|strong="H3318"\w*.\
\v 21 \w For|strong="H3027"\w* \w I|strong="H3068"\w* \w have|strong="H3068"\w* kept \w the|strong="H3068"\w* ways \w of|strong="H3068"\w* \w Yahweh|strong="H3068"\w*, \w and|strong="H3068"\w* \w have|strong="H3068"\w* not wickedly departed \w from|strong="H7725"\w* \w my|strong="H3068"\w* \w God|strong="H3068"\w*.\
