\v 6 \w His|strong="H1931"\w* \w going|strong="H3318"\w* \w out|strong="H3318"\w* \w is|strong="H1931"\w* \w from|strong="H3318"\w* \w the|strong="H3318"\w* \w end|strong="H3318"\w* \w of|strong="H1368"\w* \w the|strong="H3318"\w* heavens, \w his|strong="H1931"\w* circuit \w to|strong="H3318"\w* \w its|strong="H3318"\w* ends. There \w is|strong="H1931"\w* nothing hidden \w from|strong="H3318"\w* \w its|strong="H3318"\w* heat.\
\v 7 Yahweh’s law \w is|strong="H0369"\w* perfect, restoring \w the|strong="H5921"\w* soul. Yahweh’s covenant \w is|strong="H0369"\w* sure, \w making|strong="H0369"\w* wise \w the|strong="H5921"\w* simple.\
\v 8 Yahweh’\w s|strong="H3068"\w* precepts \w are|strong="H3068"\w* right, rejoicing \w the|strong="H3068"\w* \w heart|strong="H5315"\w*. Yahweh’\w s|strong="H3068"\w* commandment \w is|strong="H3068"\w* pure, enlightening \w the|strong="H3068"\w* eyes.\
