\v 5 They cried \w to|strong="H0001"\w* \w you|strong="H0001"\w*, \w and|strong="H0001"\w* were \w delivered|strong="H6403"\w*. They \w trusted|strong="H0982"\w* \w in|strong="H0982"\w* \w you|strong="H0001"\w*, \w and|strong="H0001"\w* were not disappointed.\
\v 6 \w But|strong="H3808"\w* \w I|strong="H3808"\w* am \w a|strong="H3808"\w* worm, \w and|strong="H0954"\w* \w no|strong="H3808"\w* man; \w a|strong="H3808"\w* reproach \w of|strong="H0413"\w* men, \w and|strong="H0954"\w* despised \w by|strong="H0413"\w* \w the|strong="H0413"\w* \w people|strong="H3808"\w*.\
\v 7 \w All|strong="H0376"\w* \w those|strong="H0376"\w* \w who|strong="H0376"\w* see \w me|strong="H3808"\w* mock \w me|strong="H3808"\w*. \w They|strong="H3808"\w* \w insult|strong="H2781"\w* \w me|strong="H3808"\w* \w with|strong="H0376"\w* \w their|strong="H3808"\w* lips. \w They|strong="H3808"\w* shake \w their|strong="H3808"\w* heads, saying,\
\v 8 “\w He|strong="H3605"\w* trusts \w in|strong="H7200"\w* Yahweh. Let \w him|strong="H7200"\w* deliver \w him|strong="H7200"\w*. Let \w him|strong="H7200"\w* rescue \w him|strong="H7200"\w*, since \w he|strong="H3605"\w* delights \w in|strong="H7200"\w* \w him|strong="H7200"\w*.”\
\v 9 \w But|strong="H3588"\w* \w you|strong="H3588"\w* brought \w me|strong="H0413"\w* \w out|strong="H0413"\w* \w of|strong="H3068"\w* \w the|strong="H3588"\w* womb. \w You|strong="H3588"\w* made \w me|strong="H0413"\w* trust \w while|strong="H3588"\w* \w at|strong="H0413"\w* \w my|strong="H3068"\w* mother’s breasts.\
\v 10 \w I|strong="H3588"\w* \w was|strong="H0517"\w* thrown \w on|strong="H5921"\w* \w you|strong="H0859"\w* \w from|strong="H5921"\w* \w my|strong="H5921"\w* mother’\w s|strong="H0517"\w* \w womb|strong="H0990"\w*. \w You|strong="H0859"\w* \w are|strong="H0859"\w* \w my|strong="H5921"\w* God \w since|strong="H3588"\w* \w my|strong="H5921"\w* \w mother|strong="H0517"\w* bore \w me|strong="H5921"\w*.\
\v 11 Don’t \w be|strong="H0517"\w* \w far|strong="H5921"\w* \w from|strong="H5921"\w* \w me|strong="H5921"\w*, \w for|strong="H5921"\w* trouble \w is|strong="H0410"\w* \w near|strong="H5921"\w*. \w For|strong="H5921"\w* there \w is|strong="H0410"\w* no \w one|strong="H0410"\w* \w to|strong="H5921"\w* help.\
\v 12 Many bulls \w have|strong="H0369"\w* surrounded \w me|strong="H4480"\w*. Strong bulls \w of|strong="H4480"\w* Bashan \w have|strong="H0369"\w* encircled \w me|strong="H4480"\w*.\
\v 13 They open \w their|strong="H5437"\w* mouths wide against \w me|strong="H5437"\w*, lions tearing prey \w and|strong="H6499"\w* roaring.\
\v 14 \w I|strong="H5921"\w* am poured \w out|strong="H5921"\w* \w like|strong="H5921"\w* water. \w All|strong="H6310"\w* \w my|strong="H5921"\w* bones \w are|strong="H6310"\w* \w out|strong="H5921"\w* \w of|strong="H5921"\w* joint. \w My|strong="H5921"\w* heart \w is|strong="H6310"\w* \w like|strong="H5921"\w* wax. \w It|strong="H5921"\w* \w is|strong="H6310"\w* melted \w within|strong="H5921"\w* \w me|strong="H5921"\w*.\
