A Psalm. A Song for the Dedication of the Temple. By David. 
\v 1 I \w will|strong="H1004"\w* extol \w you|strong="H1004"\w*, Yahweh, \w for|strong="H1004"\w* \w you|strong="H1004"\w* \w have|strong="H1004"\w* raised \w me|strong="H1004"\w* up, \w and|strong="H1004"\w* \w have|strong="H1004"\w* \w not|strong="H1732"\w* made \w my|strong="H1732"\w* foes \w to|strong="H1004"\w* rejoice over \w me|strong="H1004"\w*.\
