\v 3 \w Yahweh|strong="H3068"\w*, \w you|strong="H0413"\w* \w have|strong="H3068"\w* brought \w up|strong="H0413"\w* \w my|strong="H3068"\w* soul \w from|strong="H0413"\w* Sheol.\f + \fr 30:3 \ft Sheol is the place of the dead. \f* \w You|strong="H0413"\w* \w have|strong="H3068"\w* kept \w me|strong="H0413"\w* alive, \w that|strong="H3068"\w* \w I|strong="H3068"\w* \w should|strong="H3068"\w* not go down \w to|strong="H0413"\w* \w the|strong="H0413"\w* pit.\
