\v 6 \w I|strong="H3068"\w* hate \w those|strong="H0853"\w* \w who|strong="H3068"\w* regard lying vanities, \w but|strong="H3068"\w* \w I|strong="H3068"\w* trust \w in|strong="H3068"\w* \w Yahweh|strong="H3068"\w*.\
