\v 7 Deep calls \w to|strong="H5921"\w* deep \w at|strong="H5921"\w* \w the|strong="H5921"\w* noise \w of|strong="H0776"\w* \w your|strong="H5921"\w* waterfalls. All \w your|strong="H5921"\w* waves \w and|strong="H0430"\w* \w your|strong="H5921"\w* billows \w have|strong="H0776"\w* swept \w over|strong="H5921"\w* \w me|strong="H5315"\w*.\
\v 8 Yahweh^\sc 42:8 “Yahweh” is God’s proper Name, sometimes rendered “[Lord\sc*” (all caps) in other translations.] \w will|strong="H6963"\w* \w command|strong="H5921"\w* \w his|strong="H3605"\w* loving kindness \w in|strong="H5921"\w* \w the|strong="H3605"\w* daytime. \w In|strong="H5921"\w* \w the|strong="H3605"\w* night \w his|strong="H3605"\w* song shall \w be|strong="H6963"\w* \w with|strong="H0413"\w* \w me|strong="H0413"\w*: \w a|strong="H7121"\w* prayer \w to|strong="H0413"\w* \w the|strong="H3605"\w* \w God|strong="H0413"\w* \w of|strong="H6963"\w* \w my|strong="H3605"\w* life.\
\v 9 \w I|strong="H6680"\w* \w will|strong="H3068"\w* ask \w God|strong="H0410"\w*, \w my|strong="H3068"\w* rock, “Why \w have|strong="H3068"\w* \w you|strong="H6680"\w* forgotten \w me|strong="H5973"\w*? Why \w do|strong="H6680"\w* \w I|strong="H6680"\w* go mourning \w because|strong="H5973"\w* \w of|strong="H3068"\w* \w the|strong="H3068"\w* oppression \w of|strong="H3068"\w* \w the|strong="H3068"\w* enemy?”\
\v 10 \w As|strong="H0410"\w* \w with|strong="H3906"\w* \w a|strong="H4100"\w* sword \w in|strong="H0559"\w* \w my|strong="H0559"\w* bones, \w my|strong="H0559"\w* adversaries reproach \w me|strong="H7911"\w*, while \w they|strong="H0559"\w* continually \w ask|strong="H0559"\w* \w me|strong="H7911"\w*, “\w Where|strong="H4100"\w* \w is|strong="H4100"\w* \w your|strong="H7911"\w* \w God|strong="H0410"\w*?”\
\v 11 Why \w are|strong="H3117"\w* \w you|strong="H3605"\w* \w in|strong="H0413"\w* despair, \w my|strong="H3605"\w* soul? Why \w are|strong="H3117"\w* \w you|strong="H3605"\w* disturbed \w within|strong="H0413"\w* \w me|strong="H0413"\w*? Hope \w in|strong="H0413"\w* \w God|strong="H0430"\w*! \w For|strong="H0413"\w* \w I|strong="H3117"\w* \w shall|strong="H3117"\w* \w still|strong="H0559"\w* praise \w him|strong="H0413"\w*, \w the|strong="H3605"\w* saving help \w of|strong="H0430"\w* \w my|strong="H3605"\w* countenance, \w and|strong="H0430"\w* \w my|strong="H3605"\w* \w God|strong="H0430"\w*.
