For the Chief Musician. A Psalm by David, when Nathan the prophet came to him, after he had gone in to Bathsheba. 
\v 1 \w Have|strong="H1732"\w* mercy on me, God, according \w to|strong="H1732"\w* \w your|strong="H1732"\w* loving kindness. According \w to|strong="H1732"\w* \w the|strong="H1732"\w* multitude \w of|strong="H1732"\w* \w your|strong="H1732"\w* tender mercies, blot out \w my|strong="H1732"\w* transgressions.\
