\p \s1 Thoughts on the general depravity of the world and asking for redemption
\p## Thoughts on the general depravity of the world and asking for redemption
For the Chief Musician. To the tune of “Mahalath.” A contemplation by David. 
\v 1 \w The|strong="H5921"\w* fool \w has|strong="H1732"\w* said \w in|strong="H5921"\w* \w his|strong="H5921"\w* heart, “There \w is|strong="H1732"\w* no God.” \w They|strong="H5921"\w* are corrupt, \w and|strong="H1732"\w* \w have|strong="H5921"\w* done abominable iniquity. There \w is|strong="H1732"\w* no one who does good.\
