\p## Prayer against an ungodly enemy and complaint against an unfaithful friend
For the Chief Musician. On stringed instruments. A contemplation by David. 
\v 1 Listen \w to|strong="H1732"\w* \w my|strong="H1732"\w* prayer, God. Don’t hide yourself from \w my|strong="H1732"\w* supplication.\
\v 2 Attend \w to|strong="H0430"\w* me, \w and|strong="H0430"\w* answer me. I \w am|strong="H0430"\w* restless \w in|strong="H0430"\w* \w my|strong="H5956"\w* complaint, \w and|strong="H0430"\w* moan\
\v 3 because of \w the|strong="H6030"\w* voice of \w the|strong="H6030"\w* enemy, because of \w the|strong="H6030"\w* oppression of \w the|strong="H6030"\w* wicked. For they bring suffering on \w me|strong="H6030"\w*. In anger they hold a grudge against \w me|strong="H6030"\w*.\
\v 4 \w My|strong="H5921"\w* heart \w is|strong="H7563"\w* severely pained \w within|strong="H5921"\w* \w me|strong="H6440"\w*. \w The|strong="H6440"\w* terrors \w of|strong="H6963"\w* death \w have|strong="H7563"\w* fallen \w on|strong="H5921"\w* \w me|strong="H6440"\w*.\
\v 5 Fearfulness \w and|strong="H3820"\w* trembling \w have|strong="H4194"\w* \w come|strong="H5307"\w* \w on|strong="H5921"\w* \w me|strong="H5921"\w*. Horror \w has|strong="H3820"\w* \w overwhelmed|strong="H5307"\w* \w me|strong="H5921"\w*.\
\v 6 \w I|strong="H0935"\w* said, “Oh \w that|strong="H0935"\w* \w I|strong="H0935"\w* \w had|strong="H0935"\w* wings like \w a|strong="H0935"\w* dove! \w Then|strong="H0935"\w* \w I|strong="H0935"\w* would fly \w away|strong="H0935"\w*, \w and|strong="H0935"\w* be \w at|strong="H0935"\w* rest.\
\v 7 Behold, \w then|strong="H5414"\w* \w I|strong="H5414"\w* \w would|strong="H4310"\w* wander far \w off|strong="H5414"\w*. \w I|strong="H5414"\w* \w would|strong="H4310"\w* lodge \w in|strong="H7931"\w* \w the|strong="H0559"\w* wilderness.” Selah.\
\v 8 “\w I|strong="H2009"\w* would hurry to \w a|strong="H2009"\w* shelter \w from|strong="H7368"\w* \w the|strong="H2009"\w* stormy wind and storm.”\
\v 9 Confuse them, Lord, \w and|strong="H7307"\w* confound their language, for I have seen violence \w and|strong="H7307"\w* strife \w in|strong="H7307"\w* \w the|strong="H7307"\w* city.\
\v 10 Day \w and|strong="H7200"\w* night \w they|strong="H3588"\w* prowl around \w on|strong="H7200"\w* \w its|strong="H3588"\w* walls. Malice \w and|strong="H7200"\w* abuse \w are|strong="H2555"\w* \w also|strong="H3588"\w* within \w her|strong="H7200"\w*.\
\v 11 Destructive forces \w are|strong="H2346"\w* \w within|strong="H7130"\w* \w her|strong="H5921"\w*. Threats \w and|strong="H3915"\w* lies don’t depart \w from|strong="H5921"\w* \w her|strong="H5921"\w* streets.\
\v 12 \w For|strong="H3808"\w* \w it|strong="H7130"\w* \w was|strong="H3808"\w* \w not|strong="H3808"\w* an enemy \w who|strong="H3808"\w* insulted \w me|strong="H3808"\w*, \w then|strong="H3808"\w* \w I|strong="H3808"\w* could \w have|strong="H3808"\w* endured \w it|strong="H7130"\w*. \w Neither|strong="H3808"\w* \w was|strong="H3808"\w* \w it|strong="H7130"\w* \w he|strong="H3808"\w* \w who|strong="H3808"\w* hated \w me|strong="H3808"\w* \w who|strong="H3808"\w* raised \w himself|strong="H3808"\w* up against \w me|strong="H3808"\w*, \w then|strong="H3808"\w* \w I|strong="H3808"\w* would \w have|strong="H3808"\w* hidden myself \w from|strong="H3808"\w* him.\
\v 13 \w But|strong="H3588"\w* \w it|strong="H5921"\w* \w was|strong="H3808"\w* \w you|strong="H3588"\w*, \w a|strong="H3588"\w* man \w like|strong="H3808"\w* \w me|strong="H5921"\w*, \w my|strong="H5921"\w* companion, \w and|strong="H1431"\w* \w my|strong="H5921"\w* familiar friend.\
\v 14 We \w took|strong="H3045"\w* sweet fellowship together. We walked \w in|strong="H3045"\w* God’s house \w with|strong="H3045"\w* company.\
\v 15 \w Let|strong="H1980"\w* death \w come|strong="H1980"\w* suddenly \w on|strong="H1980"\w* \w them|strong="H0834"\w*. \w Let|strong="H1980"\w* \w them|strong="H0834"\w* \w go|strong="H1980"\w* \w down|strong="H1980"\w* alive \w into|strong="H1980"\w* Sheol.\f + \fr 55:15 \ft Sheol is the place of the dead. \f* \w For|strong="H1004"\w* wickedness \w is|strong="H0834"\w* among \w them|strong="H0834"\w*, \w in|strong="H1980"\w* \w their|strong="H0834"\w* dwelling.\
\v 16 \w As|strong="H3588"\w* \w for|strong="H3588"\w* \w me|strong="H5921"\w*, \w I|strong="H3588"\w* \w will|strong="H3381"\w* call \w on|strong="H5921"\w* God. Yahweh \w will|strong="H3381"\w* save \w me|strong="H5921"\w*.\
\v 17 Evening, morning, \w and|strong="H3068"\w* \w at|strong="H0413"\w* noon, \w I|strong="H0589"\w* \w will|strong="H3068"\w* \w cry|strong="H7121"\w* \w out|strong="H0413"\w* \w in|strong="H0413"\w* distress. \w He|strong="H0430"\w* \w will|strong="H3068"\w* hear \w my|strong="H3068"\w* voice.\
\v 18 \w He|strong="H6153"\w* has redeemed \w my|strong="H8085"\w* soul \w in|strong="H8085"\w* peace \w from|strong="H8085"\w* \w the|strong="H8085"\w* battle \w that|strong="H8085"\w* \w was|strong="H6963"\w* against \w me|strong="H6963"\w*, although there are many who oppose \w me|strong="H6963"\w*.\
\v 19 God, \w who|strong="H5315"\w* \w is|strong="H5315"\w* enthroned forever, \w will|strong="H1961"\w* hear \w and|strong="H5315"\w* answer \w them|strong="H1961"\w*. Selah. \w They|strong="H3588"\w* never change \w and|strong="H5315"\w* don’t fear God.\
