\v 22 Cast \w your|strong="H1697"\w* burden \w on|strong="H1697"\w* Yahweh \w and|strong="H8081"\w* \w he|strong="H6310"\w* \w will|strong="H3820"\w* sustain \w you|strong="H6310"\w*. \w He|strong="H6310"\w* \w will|strong="H3820"\w* never allow \w the|strong="H1697"\w* righteous \w to|strong="H3820"\w* \w be|strong="H3820"\w* moved.\
