\p \s1 Trust in God in the midst of enemies
\p## Trust in God in the midst of enemies
For the Chief Musician. To the tune of “Do Not Destroy.” A poem by David, when he fled from Saul, in the cave. 
\v 1 \w Be|strong="H1732"\w* merciful \w to|strong="H6440"\w* \w me|strong="H6440"\w*, God, \w be|strong="H1732"\w* merciful \w to|strong="H6440"\w* \w me|strong="H6440"\w*, \w for|strong="H1732"\w* \w my|strong="H1732"\w* soul takes refuge \w in|strong="H6440"\w* \w you|strong="H6440"\w*. Yes, \w in|strong="H6440"\w* \w the|strong="H6440"\w* shadow \w of|strong="H6440"\w* \w your|strong="H6440"\w* wings, I \w will|strong="H6440"\w* take refuge, until disaster \w has|strong="H7586"\w* passed.\
\v 2 \w I|strong="H3588"\w* cry \w out|strong="H5704"\w* \w to|strong="H5704"\w* \w God|strong="H0430"\w* Most High, \w to|strong="H5704"\w* \w God|strong="H0430"\w* \w who|strong="H5315"\w* accomplishes \w my|strong="H3588"\w* requests \w for|strong="H3588"\w* \w me|strong="H5315"\w*.\
\v 3 \w He|strong="H0430"\w* \w will|strong="H0430"\w* send \w from|strong="H5921"\w* heaven, \w and|strong="H0430"\w* save \w me|strong="H5921"\w*, \w he|strong="H0430"\w* rebukes \w the|strong="H5921"\w* \w one|strong="H0410"\w* \w who|strong="H0410"\w* \w is|strong="H0430"\w* pursuing \w me|strong="H5921"\w*. Selah. \w God|strong="H0430"\w* \w will|strong="H0430"\w* send \w out|strong="H5921"\w* \w his|strong="H5921"\w* loving kindness \w and|strong="H0430"\w* \w his|strong="H5921"\w* truth.\
\v 4 \w My|strong="H7971"\w* soul \w is|strong="H0430"\w* among lions. \w I|strong="H7971"\w* lie among \w those|strong="H3467"\w* \w who|strong="H0430"\w* \w are|strong="H8064"\w* \w set|strong="H7971"\w* \w on|strong="H0430"\w* fire, even \w the|strong="H7971"\w* sons \w of|strong="H0430"\w* men, whose teeth \w are|strong="H8064"\w* spears \w and|strong="H0430"\w* arrows, \w and|strong="H0430"\w* \w their|strong="H7971"\w* tongue \w a|strong="H7971"\w* sharp sword.\
\v 5 \w Be|strong="H1121"\w* exalted, God, above \w the|strong="H8432"\w* heavens! \w Let|strong="H5315"\w* \w your|strong="H7901"\w* glory \w be|strong="H1121"\w* above \w all|strong="H7901"\w* \w the|strong="H8432"\w* earth!\
\v 6 \w They|strong="H5921"\w* \w have|strong="H0776"\w* prepared \w a|strong="H5921"\w* net \w for|strong="H5921"\w* \w my|strong="H3605"\w* steps. \w My|strong="H3605"\w* soul \w is|strong="H0776"\w* bowed \w down|strong="H5921"\w*. \w They|strong="H5921"\w* dig \w a|strong="H5921"\w* pit \w before|strong="H5921"\w* \w me|strong="H5921"\w*. \w They|strong="H5921"\w* fall \w into|strong="H5921"\w* \w the|strong="H3605"\w* middle \w of|strong="H0776"\w* \w it|strong="H5921"\w* \w themselves|strong="H5921"\w*. Selah.\
\v 7 \w My|strong="H8432"\w* \w heart|strong="H5315"\w* \w is|strong="H5315"\w* \w steadfast|strong="H3559"\w*, God. \w My|strong="H8432"\w* \w heart|strong="H5315"\w* \w is|strong="H5315"\w* \w steadfast|strong="H3559"\w*. \w I|strong="H5315"\w* \w will|strong="H5315"\w* sing, yes, \w I|strong="H5315"\w* \w will|strong="H5315"\w* sing praises.\
\v 8 Wake up, \w my|strong="H3559"\w* glory! Wake up, lute \w and|strong="H0430"\w* harp! \w I|strong="H3559"\w* \w will|strong="H0430"\w* wake up \w the|strong="H3559"\w* dawn.\
\v 9 \w I|strong="H5782"\w* will give thanks \w to|strong="H5782"\w* you, Lord, among \w the|strong="H5782"\w* peoples. \w I|strong="H5782"\w* will sing praises \w to|strong="H5782"\w* you among \w the|strong="H5782"\w* nations.\
\v 10 \w For|strong="H5971"\w* \w your|strong="H3034"\w* great loving kindness reaches \w to|strong="H0136"\w* \w the|strong="H3034"\w* heavens, \w and|strong="H3034"\w* \w your|strong="H3034"\w* truth \w to|strong="H0136"\w* \w the|strong="H3034"\w* skies.\
\v 11 \w Be|strong="H8064"\w* exalted, \w God|strong="H8064"\w*, above \w the|strong="H3588"\w* \w heavens|strong="H8064"\w*. Let \w your|strong="H3588"\w* glory \w be|strong="H8064"\w* \w over|strong="H5704"\w* \w all|strong="H5704"\w* \w the|strong="H3588"\w* \w earth|strong="H8064"\w*. 
\c 58
\p \s1 Against unjust judges (or rulers)
\p## Against unjust judges (or rulers)
For the Chief Musician. To the tune of “Do Not Destroy.” A poem by David. 
\v 1 Do you indeed speak righteousness, silent ones? Do you judge blamelessly, you sons \w of|strong="H1732"\w* men?\
\v 2 No, \w in|strong="H1121"\w* \w your|strong="H8199"\w* heart \w you|strong="H1696"\w* plot injustice. \w You|strong="H1696"\w* measure out \w the|strong="H8199"\w* violence \w of|strong="H1121"\w* \w your|strong="H8199"\w* hands \w in|strong="H1121"\w* \w the|strong="H8199"\w* earth.\
\v 3 \w The|strong="H3027"\w* wicked go astray \w from|strong="H3027"\w* \w the|strong="H3027"\w* womb. \w They|strong="H0776"\w* \w are|strong="H3027"\w* wayward \w as|strong="H0776"\w* soon \w as|strong="H0776"\w* \w they|strong="H0776"\w* \w are|strong="H3027"\w* born, speaking lies.\
\v 4 \w Their|strong="H7563"\w* poison \w is|strong="H7563"\w* like \w the|strong="H1696"\w* poison \w of|strong="H1696"\w* \w a|strong="H1696"\w* snake, like \w a|strong="H1696"\w* deaf cobra that stops its ear,\
\v 5 \w which|strong="H1823"\w* doesn’t \w listen|strong="H0241"\w* \w to|strong="H0241"\w* \w the|strong="H3644"\w* voice \w of|strong="H0241"\w* charmers, no matter how skillful \w the|strong="H3644"\w* charmer \w may|strong="H5175"\w* \w be|strong="H0241"\w*.\
\v 6 Break \w their|strong="H8085"\w* teeth, \w God|strong="H3808"\w*, \w in|strong="H8085"\w* \w their|strong="H8085"\w* mouth. Break out \w the|strong="H0834"\w* great teeth \w of|strong="H6963"\w* \w the|strong="H0834"\w* young lions, Yahweh.\
\v 7 Let \w them|strong="H2040"\w* vanish \w like|strong="H3068"\w* water \w that|strong="H3068"\w* flows away. \w When|strong="H3068"\w* \w they|strong="H3068"\w* draw \w the|strong="H3068"\w* bow, let \w their|strong="H3068"\w* arrows \w be|strong="H3068"\w* made blunt.\
\v 8 \w Let|strong="H1980"\w* \w them|strong="H4135"\w* \w be|strong="H4325"\w* \w like|strong="H3644"\w* \w a|strong="H3644"\w* snail \w which|strong="H4325"\w* melts \w and|strong="H1980"\w* \w passes|strong="H1980"\w* \w away|strong="H1980"\w*, \w like|strong="H3644"\w* \w the|strong="H1980"\w* stillborn child, \w who|strong="H1980"\w* has \w not|strong="H4325"\w* seen \w the|strong="H1980"\w* sun.\
\v 9 Before \w your|strong="H2372"\w* pots \w can|strong="H1980"\w* feel \w the|strong="H1980"\w* heat \w of|strong="H0802"\w* \w the|strong="H1980"\w* thorns, \w he|strong="H1980"\w* \w will|strong="H0802"\w* sweep \w away|strong="H1980"\w* \w the|strong="H1980"\w* green \w and|strong="H1980"\w* \w the|strong="H1980"\w* burning \w alike|strong="H3644"\w*.\
\v 10 \w The|strong="H0995"\w* righteous shall rejoice \w when|strong="H3644"\w* \w he|strong="H2962"\w* sees \w the|strong="H0995"\w* vengeance. \w He|strong="H2962"\w* shall wash \w his|strong="H0995"\w* feet \w in|strong="H0995"\w* \w the|strong="H0995"\w* blood \w of|strong="H0995"\w* \w the|strong="H0995"\w* wicked,\
\v 11 \w so|strong="H3588"\w* \w that|strong="H3588"\w* \w men|strong="H7563"\w* \w shall|strong="H7563"\w* say, “Most \w certainly|strong="H3588"\w* there \w is|strong="H6662"\w* \w a|strong="H3588"\w* reward \w for|strong="H3588"\w* \w the|strong="H3588"\w* \w righteous|strong="H6662"\w*. Most \w certainly|strong="H3588"\w* there \w is|strong="H6662"\w* \w a|strong="H3588"\w* God \w who|strong="H6662"\w* judges \w the|strong="H3588"\w* earth.” 
\c 59
\p \s1 A cry for help from a violent enemy
\p## A cry for help from a violent enemy
For the Chief Musician. To the tune of “Do Not Destroy.” A poem by David, when Saul sent, and they watched the house to kill him. 
\v 1 \w Deliver|strong="H7971"\w* \w me|strong="H7971"\w* \w from|strong="H7971"\w* \w my|strong="H8104"\w* enemies, \w my|strong="H8104"\w* \w God|strong="H7971"\w*. \w Set|strong="H7971"\w* \w me|strong="H7971"\w* \w on|strong="H1004"\w* high \w from|strong="H7971"\w* \w those|strong="H0853"\w* \w who|strong="H8104"\w* rise \w up|strong="H0853"\w* \w against|strong="H8104"\w* \w me|strong="H7971"\w*.\
\v 2 \w Deliver|strong="H5337"\w* \w me|strong="H7682"\w* \w from|strong="H6965"\w* \w the|strong="H6965"\w* workers \w of|strong="H0430"\w* iniquity. \w Save|strong="H5337"\w* \w me|strong="H7682"\w* \w from|strong="H6965"\w* \w the|strong="H6965"\w* bloodthirsty men.\
\v 3 \w For|strong="H0376"\w*, behold, \w they|strong="H0376"\w* lie \w in|strong="H0376"\w* wait \w for|strong="H0376"\w* \w my|strong="H5337"\w* soul. \w The|strong="H5337"\w* mighty gather \w themselves|strong="H0205"\w* together \w against|strong="H0376"\w* \w me|strong="H3467"\w*, \w not|strong="H3467"\w* \w for|strong="H0376"\w* \w my|strong="H5337"\w* disobedience, nor \w for|strong="H0376"\w* \w my|strong="H5337"\w* \w sin|strong="H0205"\w*, Yahweh.\
\v 4 \w I|strong="H3588"\w* \w have|strong="H3068"\w* done \w no|strong="H3808"\w* wrong, \w yet|strong="H3588"\w* \w they|strong="H3588"\w* \w are|strong="H3068"\w* ready \w to|strong="H5921"\w* attack \w me|strong="H5315"\w*. Rise \w up|strong="H5921"\w*, \w behold|strong="H2009"\w*, \w and|strong="H3068"\w* help \w me|strong="H5315"\w*!\
\v 5 \w You|strong="H7200"\w*, Yahweh God \w of|strong="H5771"\w* Armies, \w the|strong="H7200"\w* God \w of|strong="H5771"\w* Israel, \w rouse|strong="H5782"\w* \w yourself|strong="H5782"\w* \w to|strong="H7200"\w* punish \w the|strong="H7200"\w* nations. \w Show|strong="H7200"\w* \w no|strong="H1097"\w* mercy \w to|strong="H7200"\w* \w the|strong="H7200"\w* wicked traitors. Selah.\
\v 6 \w They|strong="H3068"\w* return \w at|strong="H3478"\w* evening, howling \w like|strong="H3478"\w* dogs, \w and|strong="H3068"\w* prowl around \w the|strong="H3605"\w* city.\
\v 7 Behold, \w they|strong="H3611"\w* spew \w with|strong="H7725"\w* \w their|strong="H7725"\w* mouth. Swords \w are|strong="H3611"\w* \w in|strong="H7725"\w* \w their|strong="H7725"\w* lips, “\w For|strong="H7725"\w*”, \w they|strong="H3611"\w* say, “who hears \w us|strong="H7725"\w*?”\
\v 8 \w But|strong="H3588"\w* \w you|strong="H3588"\w*, Yahweh, laugh at \w them|strong="H3588"\w*. \w You|strong="H3588"\w* scoff at \w all|strong="H2009"\w* \w the|strong="H3588"\w* nations.\
\v 9 Oh, \w my|strong="H3605"\w* Strength, \w I|strong="H3068"\w* watch \w for|strong="H3605"\w* \w you|strong="H0859"\w*, \w for|strong="H3605"\w* \w God|strong="H3068"\w* \w is|strong="H3068"\w* \w my|strong="H3605"\w* \w high|strong="H1471"\w* tower.\
\v 10 \w My|strong="H8104"\w* \w God|strong="H0430"\w* \w will|strong="H0430"\w* go \w before|strong="H0413"\w* \w me|strong="H0413"\w* \w with|strong="H0413"\w* \w his|strong="H8104"\w* loving kindness. \w God|strong="H0430"\w* \w will|strong="H0430"\w* let \w me|strong="H0413"\w* look \w at|strong="H0413"\w* \w my|strong="H8104"\w* enemies \w in|strong="H0413"\w* triumph.\
\v 11 Don’t kill \w them|strong="H7200"\w*, \w or|strong="H7200"\w* \w my|strong="H7200"\w* \w people|strong="H7200"\w* \w may|strong="H0430"\w* forget. Scatter \w them|strong="H7200"\w* \w by|strong="H0430"\w* \w your|strong="H7200"\w* power, \w and|strong="H0430"\w* \w bring|strong="H6923"\w* \w them|strong="H7200"\w* down, \w Lord|strong="H2617"\w* \w our|strong="H7200"\w* shield.\
\v 12 \w For|strong="H2428"\w* \w the|strong="H7911"\w* sin \w of|strong="H2428"\w* \w their|strong="H2026"\w* mouth, \w and|strong="H3381"\w* \w the|strong="H7911"\w* words \w of|strong="H2428"\w* \w their|strong="H2026"\w* lips, \w let|strong="H0408"\w* \w them|strong="H3381"\w* \w be|strong="H0408"\w* caught \w in|strong="H2428"\w* \w their|strong="H2026"\w* pride, \w for|strong="H2428"\w* \w the|strong="H7911"\w* curses \w and|strong="H3381"\w* lies which \w they|strong="H5971"\w* utter.\
\v 13 Consume \w them|strong="H1697"\w* \w in|strong="H1697"\w* wrath. Consume \w them|strong="H1697"\w*, \w and|strong="H1697"\w* \w they|strong="H6310"\w* \w will|strong="H1697"\w* \w be|strong="H1697"\w* no more. Let \w them|strong="H1697"\w* know \w that|strong="H1697"\w* God rules \w in|strong="H1697"\w* \w Jacob|strong="H5608"\w*, \w to|strong="H1697"\w* \w the|strong="H1697"\w* ends \w of|strong="H1697"\w* \w the|strong="H1697"\w* earth. Selah.\
\v 14 \w At|strong="H0430"\w* evening let \w them|strong="H3615"\w* return. Let \w them|strong="H3615"\w* howl \w like|strong="H0776"\w* \w a|strong="H3588"\w* dog, \w and|strong="H0430"\w* go around \w the|strong="H3588"\w* city.\
\v 15 \w They|strong="H3611"\w* \w shall|strong="H3611"\w* wander up \w and|strong="H7725"\w* \w down|strong="H5437"\w* \w for|strong="H7725"\w* food, \w and|strong="H7725"\w* wait \w all|strong="H5437"\w* \w night|strong="H6153"\w* if \w they|strong="H3611"\w* aren’t satisfied.\
\v 16 \w But|strong="H0518"\w* \w I|strong="H0518"\w* \w will|strong="H3808"\w* sing \w of|strong="H0398"\w* \w your|strong="H0518"\w* strength. Yes, \w I|strong="H0518"\w* \w will|strong="H3808"\w* sing aloud \w of|strong="H0398"\w* \w your|strong="H0518"\w* loving kindness \w in|strong="H3808"\w* \w the|strong="H0398"\w* morning. \w For|strong="H0518"\w* \w you|strong="H0518"\w* \w have|strong="H7646"\w* \w been|strong="H3808"\w* \w my|strong="H0398"\w* high tower, \w a|strong="H0518"\w* refuge \w in|strong="H3808"\w* \w the|strong="H0398"\w* day \w of|strong="H0398"\w* \w my|strong="H0398"\w* distress.\
\v 17 \w To|strong="H1961"\w* \w you|strong="H3588"\w*, \w my|strong="H1961"\w* \w strength|strong="H5797"\w*, \w I|strong="H0589"\w* \w will|strong="H1961"\w* \w sing|strong="H7891"\w* praises. \w For|strong="H3588"\w* God \w is|strong="H3117"\w* \w my|strong="H1961"\w* high tower, \w the|strong="H3588"\w* God \w of|strong="H3117"\w* \w my|strong="H1961"\w* mercy. 
\c 60
\p \s1 Prayer after severe defeat in war
\p## Prayer after severe defeat in war
For the Chief Musician. To the tune of “The Lily of the Covenant.” A teaching poem by David, when he fought with Aram Naharaim and with Aram Zobah, and Joab returned, and killed twelve thousand of Edom in the Valley of Salt. 
\v 1 God, \w you|strong="H5921"\w* \w have|strong="H5921"\w* rejected \w us|strong="H5921"\w*. \w You|strong="H5921"\w* \w have|strong="H5921"\w* broken \w us|strong="H5921"\w* \w down|strong="H5921"\w*. \w You|strong="H5921"\w* \w have|strong="H5921"\w* been angry. Restore \w us|strong="H5921"\w*, \w again|strong="H3925"\w*.\
\v 2 \w You|strong="H7725"\w* \w have|strong="H0854"\w* \w made|strong="H7725"\w* \w the|strong="H0853"\w* land tremble. \w You|strong="H7725"\w* \w have|strong="H0854"\w* torn \w it|strong="H7725"\w*. Mend \w its|strong="H0853"\w* fractures, \w for|strong="H0854"\w* \w it|strong="H7725"\w* quakes.\
\v 3 \w You|strong="H7725"\w* \w have|strong="H0430"\w* shown \w your|strong="H7725"\w* people hard things. \w You|strong="H7725"\w* \w have|strong="H0430"\w* \w made|strong="H6555"\w* \w us|strong="H7725"\w* drink \w the|strong="H7725"\w* wine \w that|strong="H7725"\w* makes \w us|strong="H7725"\w* stagger.\
\v 4 \w You|strong="H3588"\w* \w have|strong="H0776"\w* given \w a|strong="H3588"\w* banner \w to|strong="H0776"\w* \w those|strong="H3588"\w* \w who|strong="H0776"\w* fear \w you|strong="H3588"\w*, \w that|strong="H3588"\w* \w it|strong="H3588"\w* \w may|strong="H0776"\w* \w be|strong="H0776"\w* displayed \w because|strong="H3588"\w* \w of|strong="H0776"\w* \w the|strong="H3588"\w* truth. Selah.\
\v 5 \w So|strong="H7200"\w* \w that|strong="H7200"\w* \w your|strong="H7200"\w* beloved \w may|strong="H3196"\w* be delivered, save \w with|strong="H7200"\w* \w your|strong="H7200"\w* right hand, \w and|strong="H7200"\w* answer \w us|strong="H7200"\w*.\
\v 6 \w God|strong="H5414"\w* \w has|strong="H5414"\w* spoken \w from|strong="H6440"\w* \w his|strong="H5414"\w* sanctuary: “\w I|strong="H5414"\w* \w will|strong="H5414"\w* triumph. \w I|strong="H5414"\w* \w will|strong="H5414"\w* \w divide|strong="H5414"\w* Shechem, \w and|strong="H6440"\w* measure \w out|strong="H6440"\w* \w the|strong="H6440"\w* valley \w of|strong="H6440"\w* Succoth.\
\v 7 Gilead \w is|strong="H3225"\w* mine, \w and|strong="H6032"\w* Manasseh \w is|strong="H3225"\w* mine. Ephraim also \w is|strong="H3225"\w* \w the|strong="H3467"\w* defense \w of|strong="H4616"\w* \w my|strong="H3467"\w* head. Judah \w is|strong="H3225"\w* \w my|strong="H3467"\w* scepter.\
\v 8 Moab \w is|strong="H0430"\w* \w my|strong="H1696"\w* wash basin. I \w will|strong="H0430"\w* throw \w my|strong="H1696"\w* sandal \w on|strong="H0430"\w* Edom. I shout \w in|strong="H0430"\w* triumph over Philistia.”\
\v 9 \w Who|strong="H3063"\w* \w will|strong="H3063"\w* bring me \w into|strong="H3063"\w* \w the|strong="H4519"\w* \w strong|strong="H4581"\w* city? \w Who|strong="H3063"\w* \w has|strong="H3063"\w* led me \w to|strong="H3063"\w* Edom?\
\v 10 Haven’t \w you|strong="H5921"\w*, God, rejected \w us|strong="H5921"\w*? \w You|strong="H5921"\w* don’t go \w out|strong="H5921"\w* \w with|strong="H5921"\w* \w our|strong="H5921"\w* armies, God.\
\v 11 Give us help against \w the|strong="H5704"\w* adversary, \w for|strong="H5704"\w* \w the|strong="H5704"\w* help \w of|strong="H5704"\w* man \w is|strong="H4310"\w* vain.\
\v 12 \w Through|strong="H3318"\w* \w God|strong="H0430"\w* we \w will|strong="H0430"\w* \w do|strong="H3318"\w* valiantly, \w for|strong="H6635"\w* \w it|strong="H3808"\w* \w is|strong="H0430"\w* \w he|strong="H0430"\w* \w who|strong="H0430"\w* \w will|strong="H0430"\w* tread down \w our|strong="H0430"\w* adversaries. 
\c 61
\p \s1 Intercession for the King from afar
\p## Intercession for the King from afar
For the Chief Musician. For a stringed instrument. By David. 
\v 1 Hear \w my|strong="H5921"\w* cry, God. Listen \w to|strong="H5921"\w* \w my|strong="H5921"\w* prayer.\
\v 2 \w From|strong="H8085"\w* \w the|strong="H8085"\w* end \w of|strong="H0430"\w* \w the|strong="H8085"\w* earth, \w I|strong="H8085"\w* \w will|strong="H0430"\w* \w call|strong="H8085"\w* \w to|strong="H8085"\w* \w you|strong="H8085"\w* \w when|strong="H8085"\w* \w my|strong="H8085"\w* \w heart|strong="H8085"\w* \w is|strong="H0430"\w* overwhelmed. Lead me \w to|strong="H8085"\w* \w the|strong="H8085"\w* rock \w that|strong="H8085"\w* \w is|strong="H0430"\w* higher than \w I|strong="H8085"\w*.\
\v 3 \w For|strong="H7121"\w* \w you|strong="H4480"\w* \w have|strong="H0776"\w* \w been|strong="H0776"\w* \w a|strong="H7121"\w* refuge \w for|strong="H7121"\w* \w me|strong="H0413"\w*, \w a|strong="H7121"\w* strong tower \w from|strong="H4480"\w* \w the|strong="H0413"\w* enemy.\
\v 4 \w I|strong="H3588"\w* \w will|strong="H1961"\w* dwell \w in|strong="H1961"\w* \w your|strong="H6440"\w* tent forever. \w I|strong="H3588"\w* \w will|strong="H1961"\w* \w take|strong="H1961"\w* \w refuge|strong="H4268"\w* \w in|strong="H1961"\w* \w the|strong="H6440"\w* \w shelter|strong="H4268"\w* \w of|strong="H6440"\w* \w your|strong="H6440"\w* wings. Selah.\
\v 5 \w For|strong="H0168"\w* \w you|strong="H5769"\w*, God, have heard \w my|strong="H0168"\w* vows. \w You|strong="H5769"\w* have \w given|strong="H5643"\w* \w me|strong="H5769"\w* \w the|strong="H2620"\w* heritage \w of|strong="H0168"\w* those who \w fear|strong="H1481"\w* \w your|strong="H5769"\w* name.\
\v 6 \w You|strong="H0859"\w* \w will|strong="H0430"\w* prolong \w the|strong="H3588"\w* king’s life. \w His|strong="H5414"\w* years \w will|strong="H0430"\w* \w be|strong="H8034"\w* \w for|strong="H3588"\w* generations.\
\v 7 \w He|strong="H3117"\w* \w shall|strong="H3117"\w* \w be|strong="H3254"\w* enthroned \w in|strong="H5921"\w* God’s \w presence|strong="H5921"\w* \w forever|strong="H1755"\w*. Appoint \w your|strong="H5921"\w* loving kindness \w and|strong="H4428"\w* truth, \w that|strong="H3117"\w* \w they|strong="H3117"\w* \w may|strong="H4428"\w* preserve \w him|strong="H5921"\w*.\
\v 8 \w So|strong="H3427"\w* I \w will|strong="H0430"\w* sing \w praise|strong="H5769"\w* \w to|strong="H0430"\w* \w your|strong="H6440"\w* name \w forever|strong="H5769"\w*, \w that|strong="H0430"\w* I \w may|strong="H0430"\w* fulfill \w my|strong="H6440"\w* vows daily. 
\c 62
\p \s1 Silence in God! The nothingness of the people
\p## Silence in God! The nothingness of the people
For the Chief Musician. To Jeduthun. A Psalm by David. 
\v 1 \w My|strong="H5921"\w* soul rests \w in|strong="H5921"\w* God alone. \w My|strong="H5921"\w* salvation \w is|strong="H1732"\w* \w from|strong="H5921"\w* \w him|strong="H5921"\w*.\
\v 2 \w He|strong="H0430"\w* \w alone|strong="H4480"\w* \w is|strong="H0430"\w* \w my|strong="H4480"\w* rock, \w my|strong="H4480"\w* \w salvation|strong="H3444"\w*, \w and|strong="H0430"\w* \w my|strong="H4480"\w* fortress. \w I|strong="H5315"\w* \w will|strong="H0430"\w* never \w be|strong="H0430"\w* greatly shaken.\
\v 3 How long \w will|strong="H3808"\w* \w you|strong="H3808"\w* assault \w a|strong="H3808"\w* man? Would all \w of|strong="H6697"\w* \w you|strong="H3808"\w* throw \w him|strong="H1931"\w* \w down|strong="H4131"\w*, \w like|strong="H3808"\w* \w a|strong="H3808"\w* leaning wall, \w like|strong="H3808"\w* \w a|strong="H3808"\w* tottering fence?\
\v 4 \w They|strong="H5921"\w* fully intend \w to|strong="H5704"\w* throw \w him|strong="H5921"\w* \w down|strong="H5186"\w* \w from|strong="H5921"\w* \w his|strong="H3605"\w* lofty \w place|strong="H0575"\w*. \w They|strong="H5921"\w* delight \w in|strong="H5921"\w* lies. \w They|strong="H5921"\w* bless \w with|strong="H5921"\w* \w their|strong="H3605"\w* mouth, \w but|strong="H0376"\w* \w they|strong="H5921"\w* curse inwardly. Selah.\
\v 5 \w My|strong="H7130"\w* soul, wait \w in|strong="H7130"\w* silence \w for|strong="H7130"\w* God \w alone|strong="H0389"\w*, \w for|strong="H7130"\w* \w my|strong="H7130"\w* expectation \w is|strong="H6310"\w* from \w him|strong="H1288"\w*.\
\v 6 \w He|strong="H3588"\w* \w alone|strong="H4480"\w* \w is|strong="H0430"\w* \w my|strong="H3588"\w* rock \w and|strong="H0430"\w* \w my|strong="H3588"\w* salvation, \w my|strong="H3588"\w* fortress. \w I|strong="H3588"\w* \w will|strong="H0430"\w* \w not|strong="H3588"\w* \w be|strong="H0430"\w* shaken.\
\v 7 \w My|strong="H3808"\w* \w salvation|strong="H3444"\w* \w and|strong="H6697"\w* \w my|strong="H3808"\w* honor \w is|strong="H1931"\w* \w with|strong="H1931"\w* \w God|strong="H3808"\w*. \w The|strong="H3808"\w* \w rock|strong="H6697"\w* \w of|strong="H6697"\w* \w my|strong="H3808"\w* \w strength|strong="H6697"\w*, \w and|strong="H6697"\w* \w my|strong="H3808"\w* \w refuge|strong="H4869"\w*, \w is|strong="H1931"\w* \w in|strong="H3808"\w* \w God|strong="H3808"\w*.\
\v 8 Trust \w in|strong="H5921"\w* \w him|strong="H5921"\w* \w at|strong="H5921"\w* all times, \w you|strong="H5921"\w* people. Pour \w out|strong="H5921"\w* \w your|strong="H5921"\w* heart \w before|strong="H5921"\w* \w him|strong="H5921"\w*. \w God|strong="H0430"\w* \w is|strong="H0430"\w* \w a|strong="H5921"\w* \w refuge|strong="H4268"\w* \w for|strong="H5921"\w* \w us|strong="H5921"\w*. Selah.\
\v 9 Surely \w men|strong="H5971"\w* \w of|strong="H0430"\w* low degree \w are|strong="H0430"\w* \w just|strong="H3605"\w* \w a|strong="H6256"\w* breath, \w and|strong="H0430"\w* \w men|strong="H5971"\w* \w of|strong="H0430"\w* high degree \w are|strong="H0430"\w* \w a|strong="H6256"\w* lie. \w In|strong="H0430"\w* \w the|strong="H3605"\w* balances \w they|strong="H6256"\w* \w will|strong="H0430"\w* go \w up|strong="H8210"\w*. \w They|strong="H6256"\w* \w are|strong="H0430"\w* \w together|strong="H5971"\w* lighter \w than|strong="H3605"\w* \w a|strong="H6256"\w* breath.\
\v 10 Don’t trust \w in|strong="H0376"\w* oppression. Don’t become \w vain|strong="H1892"\w* \w in|strong="H0376"\w* robbery. \w If|strong="H0376"\w* riches increase, don’t \w set|strong="H5927"\w* \w your|strong="H5927"\w* heart \w on|strong="H0120"\w* \w them|strong="H1992"\w*.\
\v 11 God \w has|strong="H3820"\w* spoken once; twice \w I|strong="H3588"\w* \w have|strong="H0982"\w* \w heard|strong="H3588"\w* \w this|strong="H3588"\w*, \w that|strong="H3588"\w* \w power|strong="H2428"\w* belongs \w to|strong="H3820"\w* God.\
\v 12 \w Also|strong="H0430"\w* \w to|strong="H1696"\w* \w you|strong="H3588"\w*, Lord, belongs loving kindness, \w for|strong="H3588"\w* \w you|strong="H3588"\w* reward \w every|strong="H0259"\w* \w man|strong="H0259"\w* according \w to|strong="H1696"\w* \w his|strong="H8085"\w* work. 
\c 63
\p \s1 Longing for God, the refreshment of the soul and the highest good
\p## Longing for God, the refreshment of the soul and the highest good
A Psalm by David, when he was in the desert of Judah. 
\v 1 God, \w you|strong="H1961"\w* \w are|strong="H1961"\w* \w my|strong="H1961"\w* God. \w I|strong="H1961"\w* \w will|strong="H1961"\w* earnestly seek \w you|strong="H1961"\w*. \w My|strong="H1961"\w* soul thirsts \w for|strong="H1732"\w* \w you|strong="H1961"\w*. \w My|strong="H1961"\w* flesh longs \w for|strong="H1732"\w* \w you|strong="H1961"\w*, \w in|strong="H1961"\w* \w a|strong="H1961"\w* dry \w and|strong="H3063"\w* weary land, where \w there|strong="H1961"\w* \w is|strong="H1961"\w* no water.\
\v 2 \w So|strong="H1097"\w* \w I|strong="H5315"\w* \w have|strong="H0776"\w* seen \w you|strong="H0859"\w* \w in|strong="H0430"\w* \w the|strong="H0776"\w* sanctuary, watching \w your|strong="H0859"\w* \w power|strong="H0410"\w* \w and|strong="H0430"\w* \w your|strong="H0859"\w* glory.\
\v 3 \w Because|strong="H3651"\w* \w your|strong="H7200"\w* loving kindness \w is|strong="H3651"\w* better than life, \w my|strong="H7200"\w* lips shall praise \w you|strong="H7200"\w*.\
\v 4 \w So|strong="H3588"\w* \w I|strong="H3588"\w* \w will|strong="H8193"\w* bless \w you|strong="H3588"\w* \w while|strong="H3588"\w* \w I|strong="H3588"\w* \w live|strong="H2416"\w*. \w I|strong="H3588"\w* \w will|strong="H8193"\w* lift up \w my|strong="H3588"\w* hands \w in|strong="H3588"\w* \w your|strong="H3588"\w* name.\
\v 5 \w My|strong="H5375"\w* soul \w shall|strong="H8034"\w* \w be|strong="H8034"\w* satisfied \w as|strong="H3651"\w* \w with|strong="H3651"\w* \w the|strong="H1288"\w* richest food. \w My|strong="H5375"\w* mouth \w shall|strong="H8034"\w* \w praise|strong="H1288"\w* \w you|strong="H1288"\w* \w with|strong="H3651"\w* joyful lips,\
\v 6 \w when|strong="H3644"\w* \w I|strong="H5315"\w* remember \w you|strong="H3644"\w* \w on|strong="H6310"\w* \w my|strong="H5315"\w* bed, \w and|strong="H6310"\w* think about \w you|strong="H3644"\w* \w in|strong="H5315"\w* \w the|strong="H1984"\w* night watches.\
\v 7 \w For|strong="H5921"\w* \w you|strong="H0518"\w* \w have|strong="H0518"\w* \w been|strong="H2142"\w* \w my|strong="H5921"\w* help. \w I|strong="H0518"\w* \w will|strong="H0518"\w* rejoice \w in|strong="H5921"\w* \w the|strong="H5921"\w* shadow \w of|strong="H5921"\w* \w your|strong="H5921"\w* wings.\
\v 8 \w My|strong="H1961"\w* soul stays close \w to|strong="H1961"\w* \w you|strong="H3588"\w*. \w Your|strong="H3588"\w* right hand holds \w me|strong="H1961"\w* \w up|strong="H1961"\w*.\
\v 9 \w But|strong="H3225"\w* \w those|strong="H5315"\w* \w who|strong="H5315"\w* seek \w my|strong="H0310"\w* \w soul|strong="H5315"\w* \w to|strong="H5315"\w* destroy \w it|strong="H0310"\w* \w shall|strong="H5315"\w* go into \w the|strong="H0310"\w* lower parts \w of|strong="H5315"\w* \w the|strong="H0310"\w* earth.\
\v 10 \w They|strong="H1992"\w* \w shall|strong="H0776"\w* \w be|strong="H5315"\w* given \w over|strong="H0776"\w* \w to|strong="H0935"\w* \w the|strong="H0935"\w* power \w of|strong="H0776"\w* \w the|strong="H0935"\w* sword. \w They|strong="H1992"\w* \w shall|strong="H0776"\w* \w be|strong="H5315"\w* jackal food.\
\v 11 \w But|strong="H1961"\w* \w the|strong="H5921"\w* \w king|strong="H5921"\w* \w shall|strong="H3027"\w* rejoice \w in|strong="H5921"\w* \w God|strong="H3027"\w*. Everyone who swears \w by|strong="H5921"\w* \w him|strong="H5921"\w* \w will|strong="H1961"\w* praise \w him|strong="H5921"\w*, \w for|strong="H5921"\w* \w the|strong="H5921"\w* mouth \w of|strong="H3027"\w* \w those|strong="H5921"\w* who speak \w lies|strong="H1961"\w* \w shall|strong="H3027"\w* \w be|strong="H1961"\w* silenced. 
\c 64
\p \s1 Ask for protection against malicious enemies
\p## Ask for protection against malicious enemies
For the Chief Musician. A Psalm by David. 
\v 1 Hear \w my|strong="H1732"\w* voice, God, \w in|strong="H1732"\w* \w my|strong="H1732"\w* complaint. Preserve \w my|strong="H1732"\w* life from fear \w of|strong="H1732"\w* \w the|strong="H1732"\w* enemy.\
\v 2 Hide \w me|strong="H6963"\w* \w from|strong="H8085"\w* \w the|strong="H8085"\w* conspiracy \w of|strong="H0430"\w* \w the|strong="H8085"\w* wicked, \w from|strong="H8085"\w* \w the|strong="H8085"\w* noisy crowd \w of|strong="H0430"\w* \w the|strong="H8085"\w* ones doing evil;\
\v 3 who sharpen \w their|strong="H5641"\w* tongue like \w a|strong="H5641"\w* sword, \w and|strong="H0205"\w* aim \w their|strong="H5641"\w* arrows, deadly words,\
\v 4 \w to|strong="H1697"\w* shoot innocent men \w from|strong="H1697"\w* ambushes. \w They|strong="H0834"\w* shoot at him suddenly \w and|strong="H2719"\w* fearlessly.\
\v 5 \w They|strong="H3808"\w* encourage themselves \w in|strong="H3808"\w* evil plans. \w They|strong="H3808"\w* talk about laying snares secretly. \w They|strong="H3808"\w* say, “\w Who|strong="H3808"\w* \w will|strong="H3808"\w* see \w them|strong="H3384"\w*?”\
\v 6 \w They|strong="H0559"\w* \w plot|strong="H1697"\w* injustice, \w saying|strong="H0559"\w*, “\w We|strong="H1697"\w* \w have|strong="H1697"\w* \w made|strong="H2388"\w* \w a|strong="H7200"\w* perfect \w plan|strong="H1697"\w*!” \w Surely|strong="H5608"\w* man’s mind \w and|strong="H2388"\w* heart \w are|strong="H1697"\w* cunning.\
\v 7 \w But|strong="H0376"\w* \w God|strong="H2664"\w* \w will|strong="H0376"\w* shoot \w at|strong="H0376"\w* \w them|strong="H0376"\w*. \w They|strong="H0376"\w* \w will|strong="H0376"\w* \w be|strong="H0376"\w* suddenly struck down \w with|strong="H0376"\w* \w an|strong="H0376"\w* arrow.\
\v 8 \w Their|strong="H1961"\w* \w own|strong="H1961"\w* tongues shall ruin \w them|strong="H1961"\w*. All \w who|strong="H0430"\w* see \w them|strong="H1961"\w* \w will|strong="H0430"\w* shake \w their|strong="H1961"\w* heads.\
\v 9 \w All|strong="H3605"\w* mankind \w shall|strong="H3956"\w* \w be|strong="H3605"\w* afraid. \w They|strong="H5921"\w* \w shall|strong="H3956"\w* declare \w the|strong="H3605"\w* work \w of|strong="H5921"\w* God, \w and|strong="H7200"\w* \w shall|strong="H3956"\w* wisely ponder \w what|strong="H5921"\w* \w he|strong="H5921"\w* \w has|strong="H3605"\w* \w done|strong="H3605"\w*.\
\v 10 \w The|strong="H3605"\w* righteous \w shall|strong="H0120"\w* \w be|strong="H0430"\w* glad \w in|strong="H0430"\w* Yahweh, \w and|strong="H0430"\w* \w shall|strong="H0120"\w* take refuge \w in|strong="H0430"\w* \w him|strong="H5046"\w*. \w All|strong="H3605"\w* \w the|strong="H3605"\w* upright \w in|strong="H0430"\w* heart \w shall|strong="H0120"\w* praise \w him|strong="H5046"\w*! 
\c 65
\p \s1 Song of thanksgiving for divine spiritual benefits and harvest blessings
\p## Song of thanksgiving for divine spiritual benefits and harvest blessings
For the Chief Musician. A Psalm by David. A song. 
\v 1 Praise waits \w for|strong="H1732"\w* you, God, \w in|strong="H1732"\w* Zion. Vows \w shall|strong="H1732"\w* \w be|strong="H1732"\w* performed \w to|strong="H1732"\w* you.\
\v 2 \w You|strong="H6726"\w* \w who|strong="H0430"\w* hear prayer, all men \w will|strong="H0430"\w* come \w to|strong="H0430"\w* \w you|strong="H6726"\w*.\
\v 3 Sins overwhelmed \w me|strong="H0935"\w*, \w but|strong="H8085"\w* \w you|strong="H3605"\w* atoned \w for|strong="H3605"\w* \w our|strong="H3605"\w* transgressions.\
\v 4 Blessed \w is|strong="H1697"\w* \w the|strong="H4480"\w* \w one|strong="H4480"\w* whom \w you|strong="H0859"\w* choose \w and|strong="H1697"\w* \w cause|strong="H1697"\w* \w to|strong="H1697"\w* come near, \w that|strong="H1697"\w* \w he|strong="H4480"\w* \w may|strong="H4480"\w* live \w in|strong="H1697"\w* \w your|strong="H4480"\w* courts. \w We|strong="H1697"\w* \w will|strong="H1697"\w* \w be|strong="H1697"\w* filled \w with|strong="H1697"\w* \w the|strong="H4480"\w* goodness \w of|strong="H1697"\w* \w your|strong="H4480"\w* house, \w your|strong="H4480"\w* holy temple.\
\v 5 \w By|strong="H7126"\w* awesome deeds \w of|strong="H1004"\w* righteousness, \w you|strong="H7126"\w* answer us, God \w of|strong="H1004"\w* \w our|strong="H0977"\w* salvation. \w You|strong="H7126"\w* who \w are|strong="H0835"\w* \w the|strong="H7126"\w* hope \w of|strong="H1004"\w* all \w the|strong="H7126"\w* ends \w of|strong="H1004"\w* \w the|strong="H7126"\w* earth, \w of|strong="H1004"\w* \w those|strong="H7126"\w* who \w are|strong="H0835"\w* far away \w on|strong="H1004"\w* \w the|strong="H7126"\w* sea.\
\v 6 \w By|strong="H3605"\w* \w your|strong="H3605"\w* power, \w you|strong="H3605"\w* form \w the|strong="H3605"\w* mountains, having armed yourself \w with|strong="H0430"\w* strength.\
\v 7 \w You|strong="H2022"\w* still \w the|strong="H3559"\w* roaring \w of|strong="H2022"\w* \w the|strong="H3559"\w* seas, \w the|strong="H3559"\w* roaring \w of|strong="H2022"\w* \w their|strong="H3559"\w* waves, \w and|strong="H2022"\w* \w the|strong="H3559"\w* turmoil \w of|strong="H2022"\w* \w the|strong="H3559"\w* nations.\
\v 8 They also who dwell \w in|strong="H3220"\w* faraway places \w are|strong="H1995"\w* afraid \w at|strong="H3220"\w* your wonders. You call \w the|strong="H7623"\w* morning’s dawn \w and|strong="H3220"\w* \w the|strong="H7623"\w* evening \w with|strong="H3220"\w* songs \w of|strong="H1995"\w* joy.\
\v 9 \w You|strong="H3427"\w* visit \w the|strong="H3372"\w* earth, \w and|strong="H1242"\w* water \w it|strong="H1242"\w*. \w You|strong="H3427"\w* greatly enrich \w it|strong="H1242"\w*. \w The|strong="H3372"\w* river \w of|strong="H3427"\w* God \w is|strong="H3427"\w* full \w of|strong="H3427"\w* water. \w You|strong="H3427"\w* provide \w them|strong="H3427"\w* grain, \w for|strong="H7442"\w* \w so|strong="H3427"\w* \w you|strong="H3427"\w* have ordained \w it|strong="H1242"\w*.\
\v 10 \w You|strong="H3588"\w* drench \w its|strong="H6485"\w* furrows. \w You|strong="H3588"\w* level \w its|strong="H6485"\w* ridges. \w You|strong="H3588"\w* soften \w it|strong="H3588"\w* \w with|strong="H4390"\w* showers. \w You|strong="H3588"\w* bless \w it|strong="H3588"\w* \w with|strong="H4390"\w* \w a|strong="H3588"\w* crop.\
\v 11 \w You|strong="H1288"\w* crown \w the|strong="H1288"\w* year \w with|strong="H7301"\w* \w your|strong="H1288"\w* bounty. \w Your|strong="H1288"\w* carts overflow \w with|strong="H7301"\w* abundance.\
\v 12 \w The|strong="H8141"\w* wilderness grasslands overflow. \w The|strong="H8141"\w* hills \w are|strong="H8141"\w* clothed \w with|strong="H8141"\w* gladness.\
\v 13 The \w pastures|strong="H4999"\w* are covered \w with|strong="H2296"\w* flocks. The valleys also are \w clothed|strong="H2296"\w* \w with|strong="H2296"\w* grain. They shout for joy! They also sing. 
\c 66
\p \s1 Song of gratitude from the people for their wonderful guidance and salvation
\p## Song of gratitude from the people for their wonderful guidance and salvation
For the Chief Musician. A song. A Psalm. 
\v 1 Make \w a|strong="H0776"\w* joyful \w shout|strong="H7321"\w* \w to|strong="H0430"\w* \w God|strong="H0430"\w*, \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the|strong="H3605"\w* \w earth|strong="H0776"\w*!\
\v 2 \w Sing|strong="H2167"\w* \w to|strong="H8034"\w* \w the|strong="H7760"\w* \w glory|strong="H3519"\w* \w of|strong="H8034"\w* \w his|strong="H7760"\w* \w name|strong="H8034"\w*! Offer \w glory|strong="H3519"\w* \w and|strong="H8034"\w* \w praise|strong="H8416"\w*!\
\v 3 \w Tell|strong="H0559"\w* \w God|strong="H0430"\w*, “\w How|strong="H4100"\w* \w awesome|strong="H3372"\w* \w are|strong="H4100"\w* \w your|strong="H0559"\w* \w deeds|strong="H4639"\w*! Through \w the|strong="H0559"\w* \w greatness|strong="H7230"\w* \w of|strong="H0430"\w* \w your|strong="H0559"\w* \w power|strong="H5797"\w*, \w your|strong="H0559"\w* \w enemies|strong="H0341"\w* \w submit|strong="H3584"\w* themselves \w to|strong="H0559"\w* \w you|strong="H4100"\w*.\
\v 4 \w All|strong="H3605"\w* \w the|strong="H3605"\w* \w earth|strong="H0776"\w* \w will|strong="H0776"\w* \w worship|strong="H7812"\w* \w you|strong="H3605"\w*, \w and|strong="H0776"\w* \w will|strong="H0776"\w* \w sing|strong="H2167"\w* \w to|strong="H0776"\w* \w you|strong="H3605"\w*; \w they|strong="H3605"\w* \w will|strong="H0776"\w* \w sing|strong="H2167"\w* \w to|strong="H0776"\w* \w your|strong="H3605"\w* \w name|strong="H8034"\w*.” Selah.\
\v 5 Come, \w and|strong="H1121"\w* \w see|strong="H7200"\w* God’\w s|strong="H0430"\w* \w deeds|strong="H5949"\w*— \w awesome|strong="H3372"\w* work \w on|strong="H5921"\w* \w behalf|strong="H5921"\w* \w of|strong="H1121"\w* \w the|strong="H5921"\w* \w children|strong="H1121"\w* \w of|strong="H1121"\w* \w men|strong="H0120"\w*.\
\v 6 \w He|strong="H8033"\w* \w turned|strong="H2015"\w* \w the|strong="H8033"\w* \w sea|strong="H3220"\w* \w into|strong="H2015"\w* \w dry|strong="H3004"\w* \w land|strong="H3004"\w*. \w They|strong="H8033"\w* went \w through|strong="H5674"\w* \w the|strong="H8033"\w* \w river|strong="H5104"\w* \w on|strong="H3220"\w* \w foot|strong="H7272"\w*. \w There|strong="H8033"\w*, \w we|strong="H8033"\w* \w rejoiced|strong="H8055"\w* \w in|strong="H8033"\w* \w him|strong="H8055"\w*.\
\v 7 He \w rules|strong="H4910"\w* \w by|strong="H5869"\w* \w his|strong="H7311"\w* \w might|strong="H1369"\w* \w forever|strong="H5769"\w*. \w His|strong="H7311"\w* \w eyes|strong="H5869"\w* \w watch|strong="H6822"\w* \w the|strong="H5869"\w* \w nations|strong="H1471"\w*. Don’\w t|strong="H0408"\w* \w let|strong="H0408"\w* \w the|strong="H5869"\w* \w rebellious|strong="H5637"\w* \w rise|strong="H7311"\w* \w up|strong="H7311"\w* \w against|strong="H5869"\w* him. Selah.\
