\c 69
\p \s1 A godly man's prayer for salvation from shame and anguish
\p## A godly man's prayer for salvation from shame and anguish
For the Chief Musician. To the tune of “Lilies.” By David. 
\v 1 Save \w me|strong="H5921"\w*, God, \w for|strong="H5921"\w* \w the|strong="H5921"\w* waters \w have|strong="H5921"\w* come \w up|strong="H5921"\w* \w to|strong="H5921"\w* \w my|strong="H5921"\w* neck!\
\v 2 \w I|strong="H3588"\w* sink \w in|strong="H0935"\w* deep mire, where \w there|strong="H5704"\w* \w is|strong="H0430"\w* no foothold. \w I|strong="H3588"\w* \w have|strong="H3588"\w* \w come|strong="H0935"\w* \w into|strong="H0935"\w* deep \w waters|strong="H4325"\w*, where \w the|strong="H3588"\w* floods overflow \w me|strong="H5315"\w*.\
\v 3 \w I|strong="H0369"\w* am weary \w with|strong="H0935"\w* \w my|strong="H0935"\w* crying. \w My|strong="H0935"\w* throat \w is|strong="H0369"\w* dry. \w My|strong="H0935"\w* eyes fail looking \w for|strong="H4325"\w* \w my|strong="H0935"\w* \w God|strong="H0369"\w*.\
\v 4 Those \w who|strong="H0430"\w* hate \w me|strong="H7121"\w* without \w a|strong="H7121"\w* \w cause|strong="H7121"\w* \w are|strong="H5869"\w* more than \w the|strong="H7121"\w* hairs \w of|strong="H0430"\w* \w my|strong="H3615"\w* head. Those \w who|strong="H0430"\w* want \w to|strong="H0430"\w* cut \w me|strong="H7121"\w* off, \w being|strong="H0430"\w* \w my|strong="H3615"\w* enemies wrongfully, \w are|strong="H5869"\w* \w mighty|strong="H0430"\w*. \w I|strong="H7121"\w* \w have|strong="H5869"\w* \w to|strong="H0430"\w* restore what \w I|strong="H7121"\w* didn’t take \w away|strong="H3615"\w*.\
\v 5 \w God|strong="H3808"\w*, \w you|strong="H0834"\w* know \w my|strong="H7725"\w* foolishness. \w My|strong="H7725"\w* sins aren’t hidden \w from|strong="H7725"\w* \w you|strong="H0834"\w*.\
\v 6 Don’\w t|strong="H3808"\w* \w let|strong="H3808"\w* \w those|strong="H4480"\w* \w who|strong="H0430"\w* wait \w for|strong="H3045"\w* \w you|strong="H0859"\w* \w be|strong="H3808"\w* shamed \w through|strong="H4480"\w* \w me|strong="H4480"\w*, Lord Yahweh \w of|strong="H0430"\w* \w Armies|strong="H3808"\w*. Don’\w t|strong="H3808"\w* \w let|strong="H3808"\w* \w those|strong="H4480"\w* \w who|strong="H0430"\w* \w seek|strong="H3808"\w* \w you|strong="H0859"\w* \w be|strong="H3808"\w* brought \w to|strong="H0430"\w* dishonor \w through|strong="H4480"\w* \w me|strong="H4480"\w*, \w God|strong="H0430"\w* \w of|strong="H0430"\w* Israel.\
\v 7 Because \w for|strong="H6635"\w* \w your|strong="H1245"\w* sake, \w I|strong="H3478"\w* \w have|strong="H3478"\w* borne reproach. \w Shame|strong="H0954"\w* \w has|strong="H0430"\w* \w covered|strong="H0954"\w* \w my|strong="H1245"\w* face.\
\v 8 \w I|strong="H3588"\w* \w have|strong="H3588"\w* \w become|strong="H5375"\w* \w a|strong="H3588"\w* stranger \w to|strong="H5921"\w* \w my|strong="H5921"\w* brothers, \w an|strong="H3588"\w* alien \w to|strong="H5921"\w* \w my|strong="H5921"\w* mother’s children.\
\v 9 \w For|strong="H1961"\w* \w the|strong="H1961"\w* zeal \w of|strong="H1121"\w* \w your|strong="H1961"\w* house consumes \w me|strong="H1961"\w*. \w The|strong="H1961"\w* reproaches \w of|strong="H1121"\w* \w those|strong="H1121"\w* \w who|strong="H1121"\w* reproach \w you|strong="H2114"\w* \w have|strong="H1961"\w* \w fallen|strong="H1961"\w* \w on|strong="H1961"\w* \w me|strong="H1961"\w*.\
\v 10 \w When|strong="H3588"\w* \w I|strong="H3588"\w* wept \w and|strong="H1004"\w* \w I|strong="H3588"\w* fasted, \w that|strong="H3588"\w* \w was|strong="H1004"\w* \w to|strong="H5921"\w* \w my|strong="H5921"\w* \w reproach|strong="H2781"\w*.\
\v 11 \w When|strong="H1961"\w* \w I|strong="H5315"\w* \w made|strong="H1961"\w* sackcloth \w my|strong="H1961"\w* clothing, \w I|strong="H5315"\w* \w became|strong="H1961"\w* \w a|strong="H1961"\w* byword \w to|strong="H1961"\w* \w them|strong="H1961"\w*.\
\v 12 \w Those|strong="H1992"\w* who sit \w in|strong="H5414"\w* \w the|strong="H5414"\w* gate talk \w about|strong="H1961"\w* \w me|strong="H5414"\w*. \w I|strong="H5414"\w* \w am|strong="H1961"\w* \w the|strong="H5414"\w* song \w of|strong="H4912"\w* \w the|strong="H5414"\w* drunkards.\
\v 13 But \w as|strong="H3427"\w* \w for|strong="H3427"\w* me, \w my|strong="H8354"\w* prayer \w is|strong="H3427"\w* \w to|strong="H3427"\w* \w you|strong="H3427"\w*, Yahweh, \w in|strong="H3427"\w* an acceptable time. God, \w in|strong="H3427"\w* \w the|strong="H8354"\w* abundance \w of|strong="H3427"\w* \w your|strong="H8354"\w* loving kindness, answer me \w in|strong="H3427"\w* \w the|strong="H8354"\w* truth \w of|strong="H3427"\w* \w your|strong="H8354"\w* salvation.\
\v 14 Deliver \w me|strong="H0589"\w* out \w of|strong="H0430"\w* \w the|strong="H0589"\w* mire, \w and|strong="H3068"\w* don’t \w let|strong="H6256"\w* \w me|strong="H0589"\w* sink. \w Let|strong="H6256"\w* \w me|strong="H0589"\w* \w be|strong="H3068"\w* delivered \w from|strong="H3068"\w* those \w who|strong="H3068"\w* hate \w me|strong="H0589"\w*, \w and|strong="H3068"\w* out \w of|strong="H0430"\w* \w the|strong="H0589"\w* deep waters.\
\v 15 Don’\w t|strong="H0408"\w* \w let|strong="H0408"\w* \w the|strong="H5337"\w* \w flood|strong="H4325"\w* \w waters|strong="H4325"\w* overwhelm \w me|strong="H8130"\w*, \w neither|strong="H0408"\w* \w let|strong="H0408"\w* \w the|strong="H5337"\w* \w deep|strong="H4615"\w* swallow \w me|strong="H8130"\w* up. Don’\w t|strong="H0408"\w* \w let|strong="H0408"\w* \w the|strong="H5337"\w* pit shut its mouth \w on|strong="H4325"\w* \w me|strong="H8130"\w*.\
\v 16 Answer \w me|strong="H5921"\w*, Yahweh, \w for|strong="H5921"\w* \w your|strong="H5921"\w* loving kindness \w is|strong="H6310"\w* good. \w According|strong="H5921"\w* \w to|strong="H5921"\w* \w the|strong="H5921"\w* multitude \w of|strong="H5921"\w* \w your|strong="H5921"\w* tender mercies, turn \w to|strong="H5921"\w* \w me|strong="H5921"\w*.\
\v 17 Don’t hide \w your|strong="H3068"\w* \w face|strong="H6437"\w* \w from|strong="H0413"\w* \w your|strong="H3068"\w* servant, \w for|strong="H3588"\w* \w I|strong="H3588"\w* \w am|strong="H3068"\w* \w in|strong="H0413"\w* distress. \w Answer|strong="H6030"\w* \w me|strong="H0413"\w* speedily!\
\v 18 Draw \w near|strong="H6440"\w* \w to|strong="H6440"\w* \w my|strong="H5641"\w* soul \w and|strong="H5650"\w* redeem \w it|strong="H3588"\w*. Ransom \w me|strong="H6440"\w* \w because|strong="H3588"\w* \w of|strong="H6440"\w* \w my|strong="H5641"\w* enemies.\
\v 19 \w You|strong="H0413"\w* know \w my|strong="H6299"\w* reproach, \w my|strong="H6299"\w* shame, \w and|strong="H5315"\w* \w my|strong="H6299"\w* dishonor. \w My|strong="H6299"\w* adversaries \w are|strong="H5315"\w* all \w before|strong="H0413"\w* \w you|strong="H0413"\w*.\
\v 20 \w Reproach|strong="H2781"\w* \w has|strong="H3605"\w* broken \w my|strong="H3605"\w* heart, \w and|strong="H3045"\w* \w I|strong="H3045"\w* am \w full|strong="H3605"\w* \w of|strong="H3605"\w* heaviness. \w I|strong="H3045"\w* looked \w for|strong="H3605"\w* \w some|strong="H3605"\w* \w to|strong="H3045"\w* \w take|strong="H3045"\w* pity, \w but|strong="H0859"\w* \w there|strong="H3045"\w* \w was|strong="H3605"\w* \w none|strong="H3605"\w*; \w for|strong="H3605"\w* comforters, \w but|strong="H0859"\w* \w I|strong="H3045"\w* \w found|strong="H3045"\w* \w none|strong="H3605"\w*.\
\v 21 \w They|strong="H3808"\w* \w also|strong="H3820"\w* gave \w me|strong="H3808"\w* poison \w for|strong="H3808"\w* \w my|strong="H3808"\w* food. \w In|strong="H7665"\w* \w my|strong="H3808"\w* thirst, \w they|strong="H3808"\w* gave \w me|strong="H3808"\w* vinegar \w to|strong="H0369"\w* drink.\
\v 22 \w Let|strong="H5414"\w* \w their|strong="H5414"\w* table before \w them|strong="H5414"\w* become \w a|strong="H5414"\w* snare. \w May|strong="H5414"\w* \w it|strong="H5414"\w* become \w a|strong="H5414"\w* retribution \w and|strong="H7219"\w* \w a|strong="H5414"\w* trap.\
\v 23 \w Let|strong="H1961"\w* \w their|strong="H6440"\w* eyes \w be|strong="H1961"\w* darkened, \w so|strong="H1961"\w* \w that|strong="H1961"\w* \w they|strong="H6440"\w* can’t see. \w Let|strong="H1961"\w* \w their|strong="H6440"\w* backs \w be|strong="H1961"\w* continually bent.\
\v 24 Pour \w out|strong="H7200"\w* \w your|strong="H7200"\w* indignation \w on|strong="H7200"\w* \w them|strong="H7200"\w*. Let \w the|strong="H7200"\w* fierceness \w of|strong="H5869"\w* \w your|strong="H7200"\w* anger overtake \w them|strong="H7200"\w*.\
\v 25 Let \w their|strong="H5921"\w* habitation be desolate. Let no one dwell \w in|strong="H5921"\w* \w their|strong="H5921"\w* tents.\
\v 26 \w For|strong="H3427"\w* they persecute \w him|strong="H1961"\w* whom \w you|strong="H1961"\w* \w have|strong="H1961"\w* wounded. They tell \w of|strong="H0168"\w* \w the|strong="H1961"\w* sorrow \w of|strong="H0168"\w* \w those|strong="H1961"\w* whom \w you|strong="H1961"\w* \w have|strong="H1961"\w* hurt.\
\v 27 Charge \w them|strong="H0413"\w* \w with|strong="H0413"\w* crime \w upon|strong="H0413"\w* crime. Don’t let \w them|strong="H0413"\w* come \w into|strong="H0413"\w* \w your|strong="H0834"\w* righteousness.\
\v 28 \w Let|strong="H5414"\w* \w them|strong="H5414"\w* \w be|strong="H0408"\w* blotted \w out|strong="H5921"\w* \w of|strong="H5921"\w* \w the|strong="H5921"\w* book \w of|strong="H5921"\w* life, \w and|strong="H0935"\w* \w not|strong="H0408"\w* \w be|strong="H0408"\w* written \w with|strong="H5921"\w* \w the|strong="H5921"\w* \w righteous|strong="H6666"\w*.\
\v 29 \w But|strong="H6662"\w* I am \w in|strong="H3789"\w* pain \w and|strong="H6662"\w* distress. \w Let|strong="H0408"\w* \w your|strong="H5973"\w* salvation, God, protect \w me|strong="H5973"\w*.\
\v 30 \w I|strong="H0589"\w* \w will|strong="H0430"\w* praise \w the|strong="H0589"\w* name \w of|strong="H0430"\w* \w God|strong="H0430"\w* \w with|strong="H0430"\w* \w a|strong="H0430"\w* song, \w and|strong="H0430"\w* \w will|strong="H0430"\w* magnify \w him|strong="H0430"\w* \w with|strong="H0430"\w* thanksgiving.\
\v 31 \w It|strong="H1431"\w* \w will|strong="H0430"\w* please Yahweh better than \w an|strong="H0430"\w* ox, \w or|strong="H0430"\w* \w a|strong="H0430"\w* bull \w that|strong="H0430"\w* \w has|strong="H0430"\w* horns \w and|strong="H0430"\w* hoofs.\
\v 32 \w The|strong="H3068"\w* humble \w have|strong="H3068"\w* seen \w it|strong="H3190"\w*, \w and|strong="H3068"\w* \w are|strong="H3068"\w* \w glad|strong="H3190"\w*. \w You|strong="H3190"\w* \w who|strong="H3068"\w* seek after \w God|strong="H3068"\w*, let \w your|strong="H3068"\w* heart live.\
\v 33 \w For|strong="H0430"\w* Yahweh hears \w the|strong="H7200"\w* needy, \w and|strong="H0430"\w* doesn’t despise \w his|strong="H7200"\w* captive \w people|strong="H7200"\w*.\
\v 34 \w Let|strong="H3808"\w* heaven \w and|strong="H3068"\w* earth \w praise|strong="H3588"\w* \w him|strong="H0413"\w*; \w the|strong="H0853"\w* seas, \w and|strong="H3068"\w* everything \w that|strong="H3588"\w* moves therein!\
\v 35 \w For|strong="H0776"\w* \w God|strong="H8064"\w* \w will|strong="H0776"\w* save Zion, \w and|strong="H0776"\w* build \w the|strong="H3605"\w* cities \w of|strong="H0776"\w* Judah. \w They|strong="H3605"\w* \w shall|strong="H0776"\w* settle \w there|strong="H3605"\w*, \w and|strong="H0776"\w* own \w it|strong="H8064"\w*.\
\v 36 \w The|strong="H3588"\w* \w children|strong="H1129"\w* \w also|strong="H0430"\w* \w of|strong="H0430"\w* \w his|strong="H3588"\w* \w servants|strong="H8033"\w* \w shall|strong="H3063"\w* \w inherit|strong="H3423"\w* \w it|strong="H3588"\w*. \w Those|strong="H3588"\w* \w who|strong="H3427"\w* love \w his|strong="H3588"\w* name \w shall|strong="H3063"\w* \w dwell|strong="H3427"\w* therein. 
\c 70
\p \s1 Ask for help in the search
\p## Ask for help in the search
For the Chief Musician. By David. A reminder. 
\v 1 Hurry, God, \w to|strong="H1732"\w* deliver \w me|strong="H2142"\w*. \w Come|strong="H2142"\w* quickly \w to|strong="H1732"\w* help \w me|strong="H2142"\w*, Yahweh.\
\v 2 Let \w them|strong="H5337"\w* \w be|strong="H3068"\w* disappointed \w and|strong="H3068"\w* confounded \w who|strong="H3068"\w* seek \w my|strong="H3068"\w* soul. Let those \w who|strong="H3068"\w* desire \w my|strong="H3068"\w* ruin \w be|strong="H3068"\w* turned back \w in|strong="H0430"\w* disgrace.\
\v 3 \w Let|strong="H5315"\w* them \w be|strong="H5315"\w* \w turned|strong="H5472"\w* because \w of|strong="H5315"\w* \w their|strong="H1245"\w* \w shame|strong="H0954"\w* \w who|strong="H5315"\w* say, “Aha! Aha!”\
\v 4 Let all \w those|strong="H5921"\w* \w who|strong="H0559"\w* seek \w you|strong="H5921"\w* rejoice \w and|strong="H7725"\w* \w be|strong="H7725"\w* glad \w in|strong="H5921"\w* \w you|strong="H5921"\w*. Let \w those|strong="H5921"\w* \w who|strong="H0559"\w* love \w your|strong="H5921"\w* salvation continually \w say|strong="H0559"\w*, “Let \w God|strong="H0559"\w* \w be|strong="H7725"\w* exalted!”\
\v 5 \w But|strong="H0559"\w* \w I|strong="H0559"\w* \w am|strong="H0430"\w* poor \w and|strong="H0430"\w* needy. Come \w to|strong="H0559"\w* \w me|strong="H8055"\w* quickly, \w God|strong="H0430"\w*. \w You|strong="H3605"\w* \w are|strong="H0430"\w* \w my|strong="H3605"\w* \w help|strong="H3444"\w* \w and|strong="H0430"\w* \w my|strong="H3605"\w* \w deliverer|strong="H3444"\w*. Yahweh, don’t delay. 
\c 71
\p \s1 Don't leave me in old age!
\p## Don't leave me in old age!
\v 1 \w In|strong="H3068"\w* \w you|strong="H5769"\w*, \w Yahweh|strong="H3068"\w*, \w I|strong="H3068"\w* \w take|strong="H2620"\w* \w refuge|strong="H2620"\w*. \w Never|strong="H5769"\w* \w let|strong="H0408"\w* \w me|strong="H0954"\w* \w be|strong="H0408"\w* \w disappointed|strong="H0954"\w*.\
\v 2 \w Deliver|strong="H5337"\w* \w me|strong="H0413"\w* \w in|strong="H0413"\w* \w your|strong="H5186"\w* \w righteousness|strong="H6666"\w*, \w and|strong="H6666"\w* \w rescue|strong="H5337"\w* \w me|strong="H0413"\w*. \w Turn|strong="H5186"\w* \w your|strong="H5186"\w* \w ear|strong="H0241"\w* \w to|strong="H0413"\w* \w me|strong="H0413"\w*, \w and|strong="H6666"\w* \w save|strong="H3467"\w* \w me|strong="H0413"\w*.\
\v 3 \w Be|strong="H1961"\w* \w to|strong="H0935"\w* \w me|strong="H0935"\w* \w a|strong="H1961"\w* \w rock|strong="H6697"\w* \w of|strong="H0935"\w* refuge \w to|strong="H0935"\w* which \w I|strong="H3588"\w* \w may|strong="H1961"\w* \w always|strong="H8548"\w* \w go|strong="H0935"\w*. \w Give|strong="H6680"\w* \w the|strong="H3588"\w* \w command|strong="H6680"\w* \w to|strong="H0935"\w* \w save|strong="H3467"\w* \w me|strong="H0935"\w*, \w for|strong="H3588"\w* \w you|strong="H0859"\w* \w are|strong="H0859"\w* \w my|strong="H1961"\w* \w rock|strong="H6697"\w* \w and|strong="H0935"\w* \w my|strong="H1961"\w* fortress.\
\v 4 \w Rescue|strong="H6403"\w* me, \w my|strong="H3027"\w* \w God|strong="H0430"\w*, \w from|strong="H3027"\w* \w the|strong="H3027"\w* \w hand|strong="H3027"\w* \w of|strong="H0430"\w* \w the|strong="H3027"\w* \w wicked|strong="H7563"\w*, \w from|strong="H3027"\w* \w the|strong="H3027"\w* \w hand|strong="H3027"\w* \w of|strong="H0430"\w* \w the|strong="H3027"\w* unrighteous \w and|strong="H0430"\w* \w cruel|strong="H7563"\w* \w man|strong="H7563"\w*.\
\v 5 \w For|strong="H3588"\w* \w you|strong="H0859"\w* \w are|strong="H0859"\w* \w my|strong="H3588"\w* \w hope|strong="H8615"\w*, \w Lord|strong="H0136"\w* Yahweh, \w my|strong="H3588"\w* \w confidence|strong="H4009"\w* from \w my|strong="H3588"\w* \w youth|strong="H5271"\w*.\
\v 6 \w I|strong="H5921"\w* \w have|strong="H0859"\w* \w relied|strong="H5564"\w* \w on|strong="H5921"\w* \w you|strong="H0859"\w* \w from|strong="H5921"\w* \w the|strong="H5921"\w* \w womb|strong="H0990"\w*. \w You|strong="H0859"\w* \w are|strong="H0859"\w* \w he|strong="H5921"\w* \w who|strong="H0517"\w* \w took|strong="H1491"\w* \w me|strong="H5921"\w* \w out|strong="H5921"\w* \w of|strong="H5921"\w* \w my|strong="H5921"\w* mother’\w s|strong="H0517"\w* \w womb|strong="H0990"\w*. \w I|strong="H5921"\w* \w will|strong="H0990"\w* \w always|strong="H8548"\w* \w praise|strong="H8416"\w* \w you|strong="H0859"\w*.\
\v 7 \w I|strong="H1961"\w* \w am|strong="H1961"\w* \w a|strong="H1961"\w* \w marvel|strong="H4159"\w* \w to|strong="H1961"\w* \w many|strong="H7227"\w*, \w but|strong="H1961"\w* \w you|strong="H0859"\w* \w are|strong="H0859"\w* \w my|strong="H1961"\w* \w strong|strong="H5797"\w* \w refuge|strong="H4268"\w*.\
\v 8 \w My|strong="H3605"\w* \w mouth|strong="H6310"\w* \w shall|strong="H3117"\w* \w be|strong="H3117"\w* \w filled|strong="H4390"\w* \w with|strong="H4390"\w* \w your|strong="H3605"\w* \w praise|strong="H8416"\w*, \w with|strong="H4390"\w* \w your|strong="H3605"\w* \w honor|strong="H8597"\w* \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w day|strong="H3117"\w* \w long|strong="H3117"\w*.\
\v 9 Don’\w t|strong="H0408"\w* \w reject|strong="H5800"\w* \w me|strong="H7993"\w* \w in|strong="H3615"\w* \w my|strong="H3615"\w* \w old|strong="H2209"\w* \w age|strong="H2209"\w*. Don’\w t|strong="H0408"\w* \w forsake|strong="H5800"\w* \w me|strong="H7993"\w* \w when|strong="H6256"\w* \w my|strong="H3615"\w* \w strength|strong="H3581"\w* \w fails|strong="H3615"\w*.\
