\v 14 Turn again, we beg you, God \w of|strong="H7704"\w* Armies. Look down \w from|strong="H7704"\w* heaven, \w and|strong="H7704"\w* see, \w and|strong="H7704"\w* visit this vine,\
\v 15 \w the|strong="H7200"\w* stock \w which|strong="H6635"\w* \w your|strong="H7200"\w* right hand planted, \w the|strong="H7200"\w* branch \w that|strong="H7200"\w* \w you|strong="H7725"\w* \w made|strong="H6485"\w* strong \w for|strong="H6635"\w* yourself.\
