\v 7 \w You|strong="H5493"\w* called \w in|strong="H5493"\w* trouble, \w and|strong="H3709"\w* I delivered \w you|strong="H5493"\w*. I answered \w you|strong="H5493"\w* \w in|strong="H5493"\w* \w the|strong="H5493"\w* secret place \w of|strong="H3709"\w* thunder. I tested \w you|strong="H5493"\w* at \w the|strong="H5493"\w* waters \w of|strong="H3709"\w* Meribah.” Selah.\
\v 8 “Hear, \w my|strong="H5921"\w* people, \w and|strong="H4325"\w* \w I|strong="H5921"\w* \w will|strong="H4325"\w* \w testify|strong="H6030"\w* \w to|strong="H5921"\w* \w you|strong="H5921"\w*, Israel, if \w you|strong="H5921"\w* would listen \w to|strong="H5921"\w* \w me|strong="H5921"\w*!\
\v 9 There \w shall|strong="H3478"\w* \w be|strong="H3478"\w* \w no|strong="H0518"\w* strange god \w in|strong="H3478"\w* \w you|strong="H0518"\w*, \w neither|strong="H0518"\w* \w shall|strong="H3478"\w* \w you|strong="H0518"\w* \w worship|strong="H3478"\w* any foreign god.\
\v 10 \w I|strong="H3808"\w* \w am|strong="H1961"\w* Yahweh, \w your|strong="H3808"\w* \w God|strong="H0410"\w*, \w who|strong="H0410"\w* \w brought|strong="H1961"\w* \w you|strong="H3808"\w* \w up|strong="H1961"\w* out \w of|strong="H0410"\w* \w the|strong="H1961"\w* land \w of|strong="H0410"\w* Egypt. Open \w your|strong="H3808"\w* mouth wide, \w and|strong="H1961"\w* \w I|strong="H3808"\w* \w will|strong="H1961"\w* fill \w it|strong="H1961"\w*.\
\v 11 \w But|strong="H3068"\w* \w my|strong="H3068"\w* \w people|strong="H0776"\w* didn’t listen \w to|strong="H3068"\w* \w my|strong="H3068"\w* voice. Israel desired none \w of|strong="H0776"\w* \w me|strong="H5927"\w*.\
\v 12 \w So|strong="H3808"\w* \w I|strong="H8085"\w* \w let|strong="H3808"\w* \w them|strong="H8085"\w* go after \w the|strong="H8085"\w* stubbornness \w of|strong="H6963"\w* \w their|strong="H8085"\w* hearts, \w that|strong="H8085"\w* \w they|strong="H3808"\w* \w might|strong="H3478"\w* walk \w in|strong="H3478"\w* \w their|strong="H8085"\w* own counsels.\
