\v 14 \w I|strong="H8085"\w* \w would|strong="H3478"\w* soon subdue \w their|strong="H8085"\w* enemies, \w and|strong="H1980"\w* turn \w my|strong="H8085"\w* hand against \w their|strong="H8085"\w* adversaries.\
\v 15 \w The|strong="H5921"\w* haters \w of|strong="H3027"\w* Yahweh would cringe \w before|strong="H5921"\w* \w him|strong="H5921"\w*, \w and|strong="H3027"\w* \w their|strong="H5921"\w* \w punishment|strong="H3027"\w* would last forever.\
