\c 82
\p \s1 God's judgment on unjust judges (i.e. obedient rulers)
\p## God's judgment on unjust judges (i.e. obedient rulers)
A Psalm by Asaph. 
\v 1 \w God|strong="H0430"\w* presides \w in|strong="H0430"\w* \w the|strong="H8199"\w* \w great|strong="H0430"\w* \w assembly|strong="H5712"\w*. \w He|strong="H0430"\w* \w judges|strong="H8199"\w* \w among|strong="H7130"\w* \w the|strong="H8199"\w* \w gods|strong="H0430"\w*.\
\v 2 “\w How|strong="H4970"\w* \w long|strong="H5704"\w* \w will|strong="H7563"\w* \w you|strong="H6440"\w* \w judge|strong="H8199"\w* \w unjustly|strong="H5766"\w*, \w and|strong="H6440"\w* \w show|strong="H5375"\w* \w partiality|strong="H6440"\w* \w to|strong="H5704"\w* \w the|strong="H6440"\w* \w wicked|strong="H7563"\w*?” Selah.\
\v 3 “\w Defend|strong="H8199"\w* \w the|strong="H8199"\w* weak, \w the|strong="H8199"\w* \w poor|strong="H7326"\w*, \w and|strong="H6041"\w* \w the|strong="H8199"\w* \w fatherless|strong="H3490"\w*. Maintain \w the|strong="H8199"\w* \w rights|strong="H1800"\w* \w of|strong="H8199"\w* \w the|strong="H8199"\w* \w poor|strong="H7326"\w* \w and|strong="H6041"\w* \w oppressed|strong="H6041"\w*.\
