A song. A Psalm by Asaph. 
\v 1 God, don’t keep silent. Don’t keep silent, \w and|strong="H0623"\w* don’t be still, God.\
\v 2 \w For|strong="H0430"\w*, behold, \w your|strong="H0430"\w* enemies \w are|strong="H0430"\w* stirred up. Those \w who|strong="H0410"\w* hate you \w have|strong="H0430"\w* lifted up \w their|strong="H0410"\w* heads.\
