\v 4 “Come,” \w they|strong="H5921"\w* say, “let’s destroy \w them|strong="H5921"\w* as \w a|strong="H5921"\w* \w nation|strong="H5971"\w*, \w that|strong="H3289"\w* \w the|strong="H5921"\w* name \w of|strong="H5921"\w* \w Israel|strong="H5971"\w* may be remembered no \w more|strong="H5921"\w*.”\
