\v 9 Do \w to|strong="H1961"\w* \w them|strong="H1961"\w* \w as|strong="H1961"\w* \w you|strong="H5973"\w* did \w to|strong="H1961"\w* Midian, \w as|strong="H1961"\w* \w to|strong="H1961"\w* Sisera, \w as|strong="H1961"\w* \w to|strong="H1961"\w* Jabin, \w at|strong="H1961"\w* \w the|strong="H1961"\w* river Kishon;\
