\v 18 \w that|strong="H5704"\w* \w they|strong="H5704"\w* may know \w that|strong="H5704"\w* \w you|strong="H5704"\w* alone, whose name is Yahweh, are \w the|strong="H5704"\w* Most High \w over|strong="H5704"\w* \w all|strong="H5704"\w* \w the|strong="H5704"\w* earth. 
