\p \s1 Longing for God's house (a pilgrimage song?)
\p## Longing for God's house (a pilgrimage song?)
For the Chief Musician. On an instrument of Gath. A Psalm by the sons of Korah. 
\v 1 How lovely \w are|strong="H1121"\w* \w your|strong="H5921"\w* dwellings, Yahweh \w of|strong="H1121"\w* Armies!\
