\v 8 Yahweh, \w God|strong="H0430"\w* \w of|strong="H0430"\w* \w Armies|strong="H2428"\w*, hear \w my|strong="H7200"\w* prayer. Listen, \w God|strong="H0430"\w* \w of|strong="H0430"\w* Jacob. Selah.\
\v 9 Behold, \w God|strong="H0430"\w* \w our|strong="H3068"\w* shield, look \w at|strong="H3068"\w* \w the|strong="H8085"\w* face \w of|strong="H0430"\w* \w your|strong="H3068"\w* anointed.\
\v 10 \w For|strong="H0430"\w* \w a|strong="H7200"\w* day \w in|strong="H0430"\w* \w your|strong="H7200"\w* courts \w is|strong="H0430"\w* better than \w a|strong="H7200"\w* thousand. \w I|strong="H7200"\w* would rather \w be|strong="H0430"\w* \w a|strong="H7200"\w* doorkeeper \w in|strong="H0430"\w* \w the|strong="H6440"\w* house \w of|strong="H0430"\w* \w my|strong="H7200"\w* \w God|strong="H0430"\w*, than \w to|strong="H0430"\w* dwell \w in|strong="H0430"\w* \w the|strong="H6440"\w* tents \w of|strong="H0430"\w* wickedness.\
\v 11 \w For|strong="H3588"\w* Yahweh \w God|strong="H0430"\w* \w is|strong="H0430"\w* \w a|strong="H3588"\w* sun \w and|strong="H0430"\w* \w a|strong="H3588"\w* shield. Yahweh \w will|strong="H0430"\w* give grace \w and|strong="H0430"\w* glory. \w He|strong="H3588"\w* withholds no \w good|strong="H2896"\w* \w thing|strong="H3588"\w* \w from|strong="H0977"\w* \w those|strong="H3588"\w* \w who|strong="H0430"\w* walk blamelessly.\
