\v 11 \w Truth|strong="H0571"\w* springs out \w of|strong="H7965"\w* \w the|strong="H7965"\w* earth. \w Righteousness|strong="H6664"\w* \w has|strong="H0571"\w* looked down \w from|strong="H7965"\w* heaven.\
\v 12 Yes, Yahweh \w will|strong="H0776"\w* give \w that|strong="H0776"\w* which \w is|strong="H0776"\w* good. \w Our|strong="H0776"\w* \w land|strong="H0776"\w* \w will|strong="H0776"\w* yield its increase.\
