\v 11 \w Is|strong="H4191"\w* \w your|strong="H0518"\w* loving kindness declared \w in|strong="H4191"\w* \w the|strong="H0518"\w* grave? \w Or|strong="H0518"\w* \w your|strong="H0518"\w* faithfulness \w in|strong="H4191"\w* Destruction?\
