\c 89
\p \s1 Where are God's gracious promises given to the House of David?
\p## Where are God's gracious promises given to the House of David?
A contemplation by Ethan, the Ezrahite. 
\v 1 I will sing of \w the|strong="H0387"\w* loving kindness of Yahweh forever. With my mouth, I will make known your faithfulness to all generations.\
\v 2 \w I|strong="H3045"\w* \w indeed|strong="H3045"\w* \w declare|strong="H3045"\w*, “\w Love|strong="H2617"\w* stands firm \w forever|strong="H5769"\w*. \w You|strong="H3045"\w* established \w the|strong="H3068"\w* heavens. \w Your|strong="H3068"\w* \w faithfulness|strong="H0530"\w* \w is|strong="H3068"\w* \w in|strong="H3068"\w* \w them|strong="H3068"\w*.”\
\v 3 “\w I|strong="H3588"\w* \w have|strong="H3588"\w* \w made|strong="H3559"\w* \w a|strong="H3588"\w* covenant \w with|strong="H8064"\w* \w my|strong="H3588"\w* chosen \w one|strong="H3588"\w*, \w I|strong="H3588"\w* \w have|strong="H3588"\w* sworn \w to|strong="H0559"\w* David, \w my|strong="H3588"\w* servant,\
\v 4 ‘\w I|strong="H5650"\w* \w will|strong="H5650"\w* establish \w your|strong="H3772"\w* offspring forever, \w and|strong="H5650"\w* build up \w your|strong="H3772"\w* throne \w to|strong="H5650"\w* all generations.’” Selah.\
\v 5 \w The|strong="H5704"\w* heavens \w will|strong="H2233"\w* \w praise|strong="H5769"\w* \w your|strong="H3559"\w* wonders, Yahweh, \w your|strong="H3559"\w* faithfulness also \w in|strong="H1755"\w* \w the|strong="H5704"\w* assembly \w of|strong="H2233"\w* \w the|strong="H5704"\w* holy ones.\
\v 6 \w For|strong="H3068"\w* \w who|strong="H3068"\w* \w in|strong="H3068"\w* \w the|strong="H3068"\w* skies can \w be|strong="H3068"\w* compared \w to|strong="H3068"\w* \w Yahweh|strong="H3068"\w*? \w Who|strong="H3068"\w* among \w the|strong="H3068"\w* sons \w of|strong="H3068"\w* \w the|strong="H3068"\w* \w heavenly|strong="H8064"\w* beings \w is|strong="H3068"\w* \w like|strong="H8064"\w* \w Yahweh|strong="H3068"\w*,\
\v 7 \w a|strong="H3588"\w* very awesome \w God|strong="H0410"\w* \w in|strong="H3068"\w* \w the|strong="H3588"\w* council \w of|strong="H1121"\w* \w the|strong="H3588"\w* holy \w ones|strong="H1121"\w*, \w to|strong="H3068"\w* \w be|strong="H1121"\w* feared above all \w those|strong="H1121"\w* \w who|strong="H4310"\w* \w are|strong="H3068"\w* around \w him|strong="H3588"\w*?\
\v 8 Yahweh, \w God|strong="H0410"\w* \w of|strong="H5921"\w* Armies, \w who|strong="H3605"\w* \w is|strong="H3605"\w* \w a|strong="H5921"\w* \w mighty|strong="H0410"\w* \w one|strong="H6918"\w*, \w like|strong="H5439"\w* \w you|strong="H3605"\w*? Yah, \w your|strong="H3605"\w* faithfulness \w is|strong="H3605"\w* \w around|strong="H5439"\w* \w you|strong="H3605"\w*.\
\v 9 \w You|strong="H3644"\w* rule \w the|strong="H3068"\w* pride \w of|strong="H0430"\w* \w the|strong="H3068"\w* sea. \w When|strong="H3068"\w* \w its|strong="H5439"\w* waves rise up, \w you|strong="H3644"\w* calm \w them|strong="H5439"\w*.\
\v 10 \w You|strong="H0859"\w* \w have|strong="H0859"\w* broken Rahab \w in|strong="H3220"\w* pieces, like one \w of|strong="H3220"\w* \w the|strong="H4910"\w* slain. \w You|strong="H0859"\w* \w have|strong="H0859"\w* scattered \w your|strong="H0859"\w* enemies \w with|strong="H3220"\w* \w your|strong="H0859"\w* mighty arm.\
\v 11 \w The|strong="H1792"\w* heavens \w are|strong="H0859"\w* \w yours|strong="H0859"\w*. \w The|strong="H1792"\w* earth also \w is|strong="H2220"\w* \w yours|strong="H0859"\w*, \w the|strong="H1792"\w* world \w and|strong="H5797"\w* its fullness. \w You|strong="H0859"\w* \w have|strong="H0859"\w* founded \w them|strong="H0859"\w*.\
\v 12 \w You|strong="H0859"\w* \w have|strong="H0776"\w* created \w the|strong="H0776"\w* north \w and|strong="H0776"\w* \w the|strong="H0776"\w* south. Tabor \w and|strong="H0776"\w* Hermon rejoice \w in|strong="H0776"\w* \w your|strong="H8064"\w* name.\
\v 13 \w You|strong="H0859"\w* \w have|strong="H0859"\w* a mighty arm. \w Your|strong="H0859"\w* \w hand|strong="H3225"\w* \w is|strong="H8034"\w* strong, \w and|strong="H6828"\w* \w your|strong="H0859"\w* \w right|strong="H3225"\w* \w hand|strong="H3225"\w* \w is|strong="H8034"\w* exalted.\
\v 14 Righteousness \w and|strong="H3027"\w* justice \w are|strong="H3027"\w* \w the|strong="H5973"\w* foundation \w of|strong="H3027"\w* \w your|strong="H3027"\w* throne. Loving kindness \w and|strong="H3027"\w* truth go \w before|strong="H5973"\w* \w your|strong="H3027"\w* face.\
\v 15 Blessed \w are|strong="H4941"\w* \w the|strong="H6440"\w* people \w who|strong="H6664"\w* learn \w to|strong="H6440"\w* acclaim \w you|strong="H6440"\w*. \w They|strong="H6440"\w* walk \w in|strong="H6440"\w* \w the|strong="H6440"\w* light \w of|strong="H6440"\w* \w your|strong="H6440"\w* \w presence|strong="H6440"\w*, Yahweh.\
\v 16 \w In|strong="H1980"\w* \w your|strong="H3068"\w* name \w they|strong="H3068"\w* rejoice \w all|strong="H3045"\w* day. \w In|strong="H1980"\w* \w your|strong="H3068"\w* righteousness, \w they|strong="H3068"\w* \w are|strong="H3068"\w* exalted.\
\v 17 \w For|strong="H3605"\w* \w you|strong="H3605"\w* \w are|strong="H3117"\w* \w the|strong="H3605"\w* glory \w of|strong="H3117"\w* \w their|strong="H3605"\w* strength. \w In|strong="H3117"\w* \w your|strong="H3605"\w* favor, \w our|strong="H3605"\w* horn \w will|strong="H3117"\w* \w be|strong="H8034"\w* \w exalted|strong="H7311"\w*.\
\v 18 \w For|strong="H3588"\w* \w our|strong="H3588"\w* shield belongs \w to|strong="H3588"\w* Yahweh, \w our|strong="H3588"\w* king \w to|strong="H3588"\w* \w the|strong="H3588"\w* Holy \w One|strong="H3588"\w* \w of|strong="H7161"\w* Israel.\
\v 19 \w Then|strong="H4428"\w* \w you|strong="H3588"\w* spoke \w in|strong="H3068"\w* vision \w to|strong="H3068"\w* \w your|strong="H3068"\w* \w saints|strong="H6918"\w*, \w and|strong="H3068"\w* said, “\w I|strong="H3588"\w* \w have|strong="H3068"\w* given strength \w to|strong="H3068"\w* \w the|strong="H3588"\w* warrior. \w I|strong="H3588"\w* \w have|strong="H3068"\w* exalted \w a|strong="H3588"\w* young man \w from|strong="H3478"\w* \w the|strong="H3588"\w* people.\
\v 20 \w I|strong="H0227"\w* \w have|strong="H1696"\w* found David, \w my|strong="H5921"\w* servant. \w I|strong="H0227"\w* \w have|strong="H1696"\w* anointed \w him|strong="H5921"\w* \w with|strong="H5921"\w* \w my|strong="H5921"\w* \w holy|strong="H2623"\w* oil,\
\v 21 \w with|strong="H1732"\w* whom \w my|strong="H1732"\w* hand \w shall|strong="H5650"\w* \w be|strong="H1732"\w* established. \w My|strong="H1732"\w* arm \w will|strong="H5650"\w* \w also|strong="H1732"\w* strengthen \w him|strong="H4672"\w*.\
\v 22 \w No|strong="H0637"\w* enemy \w will|strong="H0834"\w* tax \w him|strong="H5973"\w*. \w No|strong="H0637"\w* wicked man \w will|strong="H0834"\w* oppress \w him|strong="H5973"\w*.\
\v 23 \w I|strong="H3808"\w* \w will|strong="H1121"\w* beat down \w his|strong="H3808"\w* adversaries \w before|strong="H3808"\w* \w him|strong="H1121"\w*, \w and|strong="H1121"\w* strike \w those|strong="H1121"\w* \w who|strong="H1121"\w* hate \w him|strong="H1121"\w*.\
\v 24 \w But|strong="H5062"\w* \w my|strong="H6440"\w* faithfulness \w and|strong="H6440"\w* \w my|strong="H6440"\w* loving kindness \w will|strong="H6440"\w* be \w with|strong="H6440"\w* \w him|strong="H6440"\w*. \w In|strong="H6440"\w* \w my|strong="H6440"\w* name, \w his|strong="H6440"\w* horn \w will|strong="H6440"\w* be exalted.\
\v 25 \w I|strong="H8034"\w* \w will|strong="H8034"\w* \w set|strong="H7311"\w* \w his|strong="H7311"\w* hand \w also|strong="H0530"\w* \w on|strong="H5973"\w* \w the|strong="H5973"\w* sea, \w and|strong="H8034"\w* \w his|strong="H7311"\w* right hand \w on|strong="H5973"\w* \w the|strong="H5973"\w* rivers.\
\v 26 \w He|strong="H3027"\w* \w will|strong="H3027"\w* call \w to|strong="H3027"\w* \w me|strong="H7760"\w*, ‘\w You|strong="H7760"\w* \w are|strong="H3027"\w* \w my|strong="H7760"\w* Father, \w my|strong="H7760"\w* \w God|strong="H3027"\w*, \w and|strong="H3027"\w* \w the|strong="H7760"\w* rock \w of|strong="H3027"\w* \w my|strong="H7760"\w* salvation!’\
\v 27 \w I|strong="H7121"\w* \w will|strong="H0410"\w* also appoint \w him|strong="H7121"\w* \w my|strong="H7121"\w* firstborn, \w the|strong="H7121"\w* highest \w of|strong="H0001"\w* \w the|strong="H7121"\w* kings \w of|strong="H0001"\w* \w the|strong="H7121"\w* earth.\
\v 28 \w I|strong="H0589"\w* \w will|strong="H0776"\w* keep \w my|strong="H5414"\w* loving kindness \w for|strong="H0776"\w* \w him|strong="H5414"\w* forever \w more|strong="H0637"\w*. \w My|strong="H5414"\w* covenant \w will|strong="H0776"\w* stand firm \w with|strong="H0776"\w* \w him|strong="H5414"\w*.\
\v 29 I \w will|strong="H1285"\w* also make \w his|strong="H8104"\w* offspring \w endure|strong="H5769"\w* \w forever|strong="H5769"\w*, \w and|strong="H5769"\w* \w his|strong="H8104"\w* throne \w as|strong="H0539"\w* \w the|strong="H8104"\w* \w days|strong="H5769"\w* \w of|strong="H1285"\w* heaven.\
\v 30 \w If|strong="H7760"\w* \w his|strong="H7760"\w* \w children|strong="H2233"\w* forsake \w my|strong="H7760"\w* law, \w and|strong="H8064"\w* don’t walk \w in|strong="H3117"\w* \w my|strong="H7760"\w* ordinances;\
\v 31 \w if|strong="H0518"\w* \w they|strong="H0518"\w* break \w my|strong="H0518"\w* statutes, \w and|strong="H1121"\w* don’\w t|strong="H3808"\w* keep \w my|strong="H0518"\w* commandments;\
\v 32 \w then|strong="H2490"\w* \w I|strong="H0518"\w* \w will|strong="H3808"\w* punish \w their|strong="H3808"\w* sin \w with|strong="H2708"\w* \w the|strong="H0518"\w* rod, \w and|strong="H2708"\w* \w their|strong="H3808"\w* iniquity \w with|strong="H2708"\w* stripes.\
\v 33 But \w I|strong="H6588"\w* \w will|strong="H5771"\w* not completely \w take|strong="H6485"\w* \w my|strong="H6485"\w* loving kindness from \w him|strong="H6485"\w*, nor allow \w my|strong="H6485"\w* faithfulness \w to|strong="H5771"\w* fail.\
\v 34 \w I|strong="H3808"\w* \w will|strong="H3808"\w* \w not|strong="H3808"\w* break \w my|strong="H3808"\w* covenant, \w nor|strong="H3808"\w* alter what \w my|strong="H3808"\w* lips \w have|strong="H3808"\w* uttered.\
\v 35 Once \w I|strong="H3808"\w* \w have|strong="H3808"\w* sworn \w by|strong="H3808"\w* \w my|strong="H3808"\w* holiness, \w I|strong="H3808"\w* \w will|strong="H3808"\w* \w not|strong="H3808"\w* lie \w to|strong="H3808"\w* David.\
\v 36 \w His|strong="H1732"\w* offspring \w will|strong="H0518"\w* endure forever, \w his|strong="H1732"\w* throne like \w the|strong="H0518"\w* sun before me.\
\v 37 \w It|strong="H1961"\w* \w will|strong="H1961"\w* \w be|strong="H1961"\w* established \w forever|strong="H5769"\w* \w like|strong="H1961"\w* \w the|strong="H1961"\w* moon, \w the|strong="H1961"\w* faithful witness \w in|strong="H1961"\w* \w the|strong="H1961"\w* sky.” Selah.\
\v 38 But \w you|strong="H5769"\w* \w have|strong="H0539"\w* rejected \w and|strong="H5769"\w* spurned. \w You|strong="H5769"\w* \w have|strong="H0539"\w* \w been|strong="H5769"\w* angry with \w your|strong="H3559"\w* anointed.\
\v 39 \w You|strong="H0859"\w* \w have|strong="H0859"\w* renounced \w the|strong="H5973"\w* covenant of \w your|strong="H0859"\w* servant. \w You|strong="H0859"\w* \w have|strong="H0859"\w* defiled \w his|strong="H5973"\w* crown \w in|strong="H5973"\w* \w the|strong="H5973"\w* dust.\
\v 40 \w You|strong="H0776"\w* \w have|strong="H0776"\w* broken down all \w his|strong="H5010"\w* hedges. \w You|strong="H0776"\w* \w have|strong="H0776"\w* brought \w his|strong="H5010"\w* strongholds \w to|strong="H0776"\w* ruin.\
\v 41 \w All|strong="H3605"\w* \w who|strong="H3605"\w* pass \w by|strong="H3605"\w* \w the|strong="H3605"\w* \w way|strong="H3605"\w* rob \w him|strong="H7760"\w*. \w He|strong="H3605"\w* \w has|strong="H3605"\w* become \w a|strong="H7760"\w* reproach \w to|strong="H3605"\w* \w his|strong="H3605"\w* neighbors.\
\v 42 \w You|strong="H3605"\w* \w have|strong="H1961"\w* exalted \w the|strong="H3605"\w* right hand \w of|strong="H1870"\w* \w his|strong="H3605"\w* adversaries. \w You|strong="H3605"\w* \w have|strong="H1961"\w* \w made|strong="H1961"\w* \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w of|strong="H1870"\w* \w his|strong="H3605"\w* enemies rejoice.\
\v 43 Yes, \w you|strong="H3605"\w* \w turn|strong="H7311"\w* back \w the|strong="H3605"\w* edge \w of|strong="H3605"\w* \w his|strong="H3605"\w* sword, \w and|strong="H3225"\w* haven’t supported \w him|strong="H3605"\w* \w in|strong="H8055"\w* battle.\
\v 44 \w You|strong="H7725"\w* \w have|strong="H0637"\w* ended \w his|strong="H7725"\w* splendor, \w and|strong="H6965"\w* thrown \w his|strong="H7725"\w* throne down \w to|strong="H7725"\w* \w the|strong="H7725"\w* ground.\
\v 45 \w You|strong="H0776"\w* \w have|strong="H0776"\w* shortened \w the|strong="H0776"\w* days \w of|strong="H0776"\w* \w his|strong="H4048"\w* youth. \w You|strong="H0776"\w* \w have|strong="H0776"\w* covered him \w with|strong="H0776"\w* shame. Selah.\
\v 46 How \w long|strong="H3117"\w*, Yahweh? \w Will|strong="H3117"\w* \w you|strong="H5921"\w* hide \w yourself|strong="H5921"\w* \w forever|strong="H3117"\w*? \w Will|strong="H3117"\w* \w your|strong="H5921"\w* wrath burn \w like|strong="H5921"\w* fire?\
\v 47 Remember \w how|strong="H4100"\w* short \w my|strong="H3068"\w* \w time|strong="H5704"\w* \w is|strong="H3068"\w*, \w for|strong="H3068"\w* \w what|strong="H4100"\w* vanity \w you|strong="H5704"\w* \w have|strong="H3068"\w* created \w all|strong="H5704"\w* \w the|strong="H3068"\w* children \w of|strong="H3068"\w* men!\
\v 48 \w What|strong="H4100"\w* \w man|strong="H0120"\w* \w is|strong="H4100"\w* \w he|strong="H5921"\w* \w who|strong="H3605"\w* \w shall|strong="H1121"\w* live \w and|strong="H1121"\w* \w not|strong="H1121"\w* see death, \w who|strong="H3605"\w* \w shall|strong="H1121"\w* deliver \w his|strong="H3605"\w* soul \w from|strong="H5921"\w* \w the|strong="H3605"\w* power \w of|strong="H1121"\w* Sheol?\f + \fr 89:48 \ft Sheol is the place of the dead. \f* Selah.\
\v 49 Lord, \w where|strong="H3808"\w* \w are|strong="H3027"\w* \w your|strong="H7200"\w* former loving kindnesses, \w which|strong="H4310"\w* \w you|strong="H3808"\w* swore \w to|strong="H3027"\w* \w David|strong="H3027"\w* \w in|strong="H5315"\w* \w your|strong="H7200"\w* faithfulness?\
