\v 51 \w With|strong="H3605"\w* which \w your|strong="H3605"\w* enemies \w have|strong="H5650"\w* mocked, Yahweh, \w with|strong="H3605"\w* which \w they|strong="H5971"\w* \w have|strong="H5650"\w* mocked \w the|strong="H3605"\w* footsteps \w of|strong="H5650"\w* \w your|strong="H3605"\w* anointed \w one|strong="H3605"\w*.\
\v 52 Blessed \w be|strong="H3068"\w* \w Yahweh|strong="H3068"\w* forever more. Amen, \w and|strong="H3068"\w* Amen.
