\c 90
\p \s1 Eternal God the refuge of the perishable
\p## Eternal God the refuge of the perishable
#
# BOOK 4
A Prayer by Moses, the man of God.\f + \fr 90:0 \ft The Hebrew word rendered “God” is “אֱלֹהִ֑ים” (Elohim). \f* 
